insert into public.spike_i18n_packs(language_code,display_name,translations,version) values ('yo', 'yo', '{"# Channels":"# àwọn ikanni","(optional)":"(àṣàyàn)","+ Achievement":"+ aṣeyọri","+ Challenge":"+ ìpèníjà","+ Mission":"+ iṣẹ́","+ Package":"+ apo","+ Room":"+ Yara","+8% this week":"+8% èyí week","0 XP":"0 XP","0 items":"0 àwọn ohun","0 online":"0 lórí ayélujára","0 unlocked":"0 ṣí silẹ","1 year":"1 ọdún","1 year 6 months":"1 ọdún 6 months","1,000 XP":"1,000 XP","1. A room member repeatedly posts spam. What should a creator do first?":"1. Kan yara ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ repeatedly àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ spam. Kí should kan olùṣẹ̀dá do first?","1. Complete your identity":"1. Complete rẹ ìdánimọ̀","1. Create the mission":"1. Ṣẹ̀dá naa mission","1. Policy principles":"1. Ìlànà principles","10. Copyright and intellectual property":"10. Copyright ati intellectual property","100 XP":"100 XP","100 XP to Level 2":"100 XP si Ipele 2","11. Transparency and accountability":"11. Transparency ati accountability","12 lessons":"12 lessons","12. Policy changes":"12. Ìlànà àwọn àyípadà","14 lessons":"14 lessons","15m":"15m","16 lessons":"16 lessons","1X2":"1X2","1h":"1h","1× XP":"1× XP","2 lessons + a short check":"2 lessons + kan short ṣàyẹ̀wò","2. Publish useful content":"2. Publish wúlò àkóónú","2. Safety":"2. Ààbò","2. What is the best room rule?":"2. Kí jẹ naa best yara rule?","2. XP is also difficulty":"2. XP jẹ also difficulty","24 hours":"24 hours","24h":"24h","250 XP":"250 XP","3 this week":"3 èyí week","3 topics need attention":"3 topics níláti attention","3. A creator should give moderators power based mainly on:":"3. Kan olùṣẹ̀dá should give moderators power based mainly lórí:","3. Build real relationships":"3. Build real relationships","3. Join and contribute":"3. Darapọ̀ ati contribute","3. Prohibited content":"3. Ewọ̀ àkóónú","30 days":"30 ọjọ́","31 sections":"31 sections","4. Community conduct":"4. Àwùjọ conduct","4. Completion and reward":"4. Completion ati reward","4. Participate in Rooms":"4. Kópa ní Awọn yara","4. What should happen when a serious safety issue is reported?":"4. Kí should happen nígbà kan serious ààbò issue jẹ reported?","48 hours":"48 hours","5 questions · 5 min":"5 questions · 5 min","5. Maintain your streak":"5. Maintain rẹ ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí","5. Privacy":"5. Ìpamọ́","5. The strongest community is built by:":"5. Naa strongest àwùjọ jẹ built by:","50 XP":"50 XP","500 XP":"500 XP","6-digit verification code":"6-digit verification kóòdù","6. Platform abuse":"6. Platform abuse","6. Protect quality":"6. Protect quality","7 days":"7 ọjọ́","7. Enforcement":"7. Enforcement","7. Use discovery intelligently":"7. Lo ìwádìí intelligently","72 hours":"72 hours","8 chapters · 31 sections · worked examples · review.":"8 chapters · 31 sections · worked examples · àtúnyẹ̀wò.","8. Appeals":"8. Appeals","8. Use premium tools responsibly":"8. Lo premium tools responsibly","9. Recommendation safety":"9. Recommendation ààbò","9Y":"9Y","@spike":"@spike","A Room Account gives you a Room-specific handle, display name and optional bio. New Room Accounts start at Novice and can earn Room XP through Room activity.":"Kan Yara Akọọlẹ gives ẹ kan Yara-specific handle, display orúkọ ati àṣàyàn bio. Tuntun Yara Accounts bẹ̀rẹ̀ at Novice ati le earn Yara XP nipasẹ̀ Yara iṣẹ́.","A community space for people who want an ongoing place to connect, talk and participate together.":"Kan àwùjọ space fun àwọn ènìyàn ta fẹ́ kan ongoing place si sopọ̀, talk ati kópa together.","A compact view of how you''re participating across SPIKE.":"Kan compact wo ti báwo ẹ''re participating across SPIKE.","A connected sequence of ideas where each entry builds on the previous contribution.":"Kan connected sequence ti ideas níbo each entry builds lórí naa previous contribution.","A detection signal is not automatically proof of a violation. Systems should distinguish clear violations from context-dependent cases and route uncertain cases to review when appropriate.":"Kan detection àmì jẹ not automatically proof ti kan violation. Systems should distinguish ko violations láti context-dependent àwọn ọ̀ràn ati route uncertain àwọn ọ̀ràn si àtúnyẹ̀wò nígbà appropriate.","A friendly head-to-head challenge between two friends where eligible community members vote for the winner.":"Kan friendly head-si-head challenge between two àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ níbo yẹ àwùjọ àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ vote fun naa winner.","A limited-time competition that turns eligible SPIKE World activity into Season Points and a shared leaderboard.":"Kan limited-àkókò competition pé turns yẹ SPIKE Ayé iṣẹ́ into Season Points ati kan shared leaderboard.","A prediction says high confidence. Is it guaranteed?":"Kan prediction says gíga ìgboyà. Jẹ it guaranteed?","A quick confirmation before you continue.":"Kan quick confirmation ṣáájú ẹ tẹ̀síwájú.","A shared challenge where members work toward one community goal before the deadline.":"Kan shared challenge níbo àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ work toward one àwùjọ goal ṣáájú naa deadline.","A short lesson, followed by three recall questions. Finish this before starting another topic.":"Kan short ẹ̀kọ́, followed by three recall questions. Finish èyí ṣáájú starting another topic.","A simple daily routine keeps SPIKE useful without turning it into a race to generate activity.":"Kan simple ojoojúmọ́ routine keeps SPIKE wúlò without turning it into kan race si generate iṣẹ́.","A simple view of your current Feed and feature activity.":"Kan simple wo ti rẹ current Ìkànnì ati feature iṣẹ́.","A strong creator is consistent, clear, fair and useful. Good rules and good moderation matter more than raw message volume.":"Kan strong olùṣẹ̀dá jẹ consistent, ko, dáadáa ati wúlò. Good àwọn òfin ati good ìṣàkóso matter síi than raw ifiranṣẹ́ volume.","A unified layer for reputation, discovery, conversations, Rooms, Events, memory, creators and your personal activity. These upgrades work with the systems already inside SPIKE instead of replacing them.":"Kan unified layer fun reputation, ìwádìí, àwọn ìjíròrò, Awọn yara, Events, memory, creators ati rẹ personal iṣẹ́. These upgrades work pẹ̀lú naa systems already inside SPIKE instead ti replacing them.","A user''s personal muted-word preference changes that user''s feed. A platform prohibited-content rule changes content eligibility for everyone. These systems must remain separate.":"Kan olùmúlò''s personal muted-word preference àwọn àyípadà pé olùmúlò''s ìkànnì. Kan platform ewọ̀-àkóónú rule àwọn àyípadà àkóónú eligibility fun gbogbo ènìyàn. These systems must remain separate.","ABOUT THIS MEMBER":"Nípa Èyí Ọmọ ẹgbẹ́","AI":"AI","AI Assist":"AI Assist","Aa":"Aa","About":"Nípa","About this room":"Nípa èyí yara","Accept":"Gba","Account":"Akọọlẹ","Account & identity":"Akọọlẹ & ìdánimọ̀","Account access":"Akọọlẹ ìwọlé","Account age requirement: your SPIKE account must be at least":"Akọọlẹ age requirement: rẹ SPIKE akọọlẹ must be at least","Account controls":"Akọọlẹ controls","Account safety and platform policy remain governed by SPIKE''s existing privacy, moderation and appeals systems.":"Akọọlẹ ààbò ati platform ìlànà remain governed by SPIKE''s existing ìpamọ́, ìṣàkóso ati appeals systems.","Account, Sessions & Loading":"Akọọlẹ, Sessions & Ń gbé","Achievements":"awọn aṣeyọri","Achievements are one-time milestones for activity such as connections, creation, engagement, levels and streaks. The Hub shows whether each achievement is unlocked.":"Achievements jẹ one-àkókò milestones fun iṣẹ́ such as connections, creation, engagement, levels ati streaks. Naa Hub shows whether each achievement jẹ unlocked.","Act":"Act","Active":"Ṣiṣẹ́","Active packages":"Ṣiṣẹ́ packages","Active users (last 30 days)":"Ṣiṣẹ́ àwọn olùmúlò (last 30 ọjọ́)","Activity":"Iṣẹ́","Activity trend":"Iṣẹ́ trend","Activity type":"Iṣẹ́ type","Add a clear topic and optional context.":"Add kan ko topic ati àṣàyàn context.","Add a display name, username, bio and useful profile details. Your profile is your public identity.":"Add kan display orúkọ, username, bio ati wúlò profaili details. Rẹ profaili jẹ rẹ àgbàlá ìdánimọ̀.","Add an optional description.":"Add kan àṣàyàn àpèjúwe.","Add governed term":"Add governed term","Add governed term or phrase":"Add governed term tabi gbolóhùn","Add hook":"Add hook","Add link":"Add ọ̀nà asopọ̀","Add media to your Signal.":"Add àwọn mídíà si rẹ Àmì.","Admin":"Alákóso","Admin actions use protected Supabase functions.":"Alákóso àwọn ìṣe lo protected Supabase functions.","Administration":"Administration","Administrative accountability":"Administrative accountability","Administrative moderation decisions should be permission-controlled and logged. Privileged tools should not bypass the policy record.":"Administrative ìṣàkóso decisions should be permission-controlled ati logged. Privileged tools should not bypass naa ìlànà record.","Advance your rank":"Advance rẹ rank","After verification, SPIKE gives you a lifetime SP ID. You can copy it from your profile.":"After verification, SPIKE gives ẹ kan lifetime SP Idánimọ̀. Ẹ le ẹ̀dà it láti rẹ profaili.","Alerts":"Alerts","Algebra, numbers & functions":"Algebra, numbers & functions","Algorithms & computing":"Algorithms & computing","All":"Gbogbo","All Friends":"Gbogbo Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́","All Supabase Auth-registered users with their SPIKE profile, SP_ID, wallet and Rooms membership.":"Gbogbo Supabase Auth-registered àwọn olùmúlò pẹ̀lú their SPIKE profaili, SP_Idánimọ̀, wallet ati Awọn yara membership.","All activity":"Gbogbo iṣẹ́","All leagues":"Gbogbo leagues","All registered Auth users":"Gbogbo registered Auth àwọn olùmúlò","All time":"Gbogbo àkókò","Allow browser-level notifications when supported.":"Allow àwáríàyé-ipele àwọn ìfitónilétí nígbà ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn.","Allow calls":"Allow calls","Allow eligible review.":"Allow yẹ àtúnyẹ̀wò.","Allow messages":"Allow àwọn ifiranṣẹ́","Allow your profile to appear in discovery":"Allow rẹ profaili si appear ní ìwádìí","Allow your profile to appear in profile discovery.":"Allow rẹ profaili si appear ní profaili ìwádìí.","Almost there":"Almost there","Almost there.":"Almost there.","Already have an account?":"Already have kan akọọlẹ?","An approved appeal can restore eligible content and overturn the original decision. A rejected appeal leaves the enforcement in place. Both outcomes must be recorded in an immutable audit trail.":"Kan approved ẹ̀bẹ̀ le restore yẹ àkóónú ati overturn naa original decision. Kan rejected ẹ̀bẹ̀ leaves naa enforcement ní place. Méjèèjì outcomes must be recorded ní kan immutable audit trail.","Announcements":"Announcements","Anti-abuse caps JSON":"Anti-abuse caps JSON","Anti-claim architecture:":"Anti-claim architecture:","Appeal":"Ẹ̀bẹ̀","Appeal decisions":"Ẹ̀bẹ̀ decisions","Appeal decisions appear here and in notifications.":"Ẹ̀bẹ̀ decisions appear here ati ní àwọn ìfitónilétí.","Appeal eligibility":"Ẹ̀bẹ̀ eligibility","Appeal queue":"Ẹ̀bẹ̀ queue","Appealed":"Appealed","Appeals":"Appeals","Appeals are a separate decision layer. An appeal should never silently edit or erase the original moderation record.":"Appeals jẹ kan separate decision layer. Kan ẹ̀bẹ̀ should never silently ṣàtúnṣe tabi erase naa original ìṣàkóso record.","Appearance":"Appearance","Approved":"Approved","Archived":"Archived","Arctic Platinum":"Arctic Platinum","Are you sure?":"Jẹ ẹ sure?","Arts":"Arts","Ask":"Ask","Ask AI":"Ask AI","Ask SPIKE AI":"Ask SPIKE AI","Ask SPIKE anything about the app…":"Ask SPIKE anything nípa naa app…","Ask a question":"Ask kan question","Attacks, dehumanization or calls for harm targeting people because of protected characteristics are prohibited. Discussion, criticism, reporting or educational context can require contextual review.":"Attacks, dehumanization tabi calls fun harm targeting àwọn ènìyàn because ti protected characteristics jẹ ewọ̀. Discussion, criticism, reporting tabi educational context le require contextual àtúnyẹ̀wò.","Attempts to compromise SPIKE or evade its controls are prohibited.":"Attempts si compromise SPIKE tabi evade its controls jẹ ewọ̀.","Audience":"Audience","Audience: Everyone":"Audience: Gbogbo ènìyàn","Audio & Video Calls":"Audio & Video Calls","Aurora Glass":"Aurora Glass","Auto":"Auto","Automatic Achievements":"Automatic awọn aṣeyọri","Automatic removal should be reserved for rules with sufficiently high confidence. The moderation event should preserve the matched policy ID, policy version, decision source, timestamp and relevant evidence.":"Automatic removal should be reserved fun àwọn òfin pẹ̀lú sufficiently gíga ìgboyà. Naa ìṣàkóso event should preserve naa matched ìlànà Idánimọ̀, ìlànà version, decision source, timestamp ati relevant evidence.","Automatic takedown":"Automatic takedown","Avatar image":"Avatar image","Avoid spam, repetitive comments, engagement bait and artificial activity. Sustainable reputation wins.":"Avoid spam, repetitive comments, engagement bait ati artificial iṣẹ́. Sustainable reputation wins.","BEST CONFIDENCE":"BEST Ìgboyà","BIOLOGY":"BIOLOGY","BTTS":"BTTS","Back":"Padà","Back to Rooms":"Padà si Awọn yara","Back to SPIKE":"Padà si SPIKE","Back to SPIKE sign in":"Padà si SPIKE wole ní","Badge":"Badge","Banner ends at (optional)":"Banner ends at (àṣàyàn)","Based on what you are learning now.":"Based lórí kí ẹ jẹ learning bayìí.","Battles":"Battles","Battles turn posts into competition. Chains turn ideas into journeys. Missions turn activity into teamwork. Seasons make progress matter. Circles give people a home.":"Battles turn àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ into competition. Chains turn ideas into journeys. Missions turn iṣẹ́ into teamwork. Seasons make ìlọsíwájú matter. Circles give àwọn ènìyàn kan ilé.","Battles, Chains, Missions, Seasons & Circles":"Battles, Chains, àwọn iṣẹ́, Seasons & Circles","Become a SPIKE Creator":"Become kan SPIKE Olùṣẹ̀dá","Become a member to participate in the conversation.":"Become kan ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ si kópa ní naa ìjíròrò.","Best experience:":"Best experience:","Best first move: make your profile useful, follow people you genuinely care about, and start participating before chasing numbers.":"Best first move: make rẹ profaili wúlò, follow àwọn ènìyàn ẹ genuinely care nípa, ati bẹ̀rẹ̀ participating ṣáájú chasing numbers.","Best-practice checklist":"Best-practice checklist","Best-ranked posts right now, updated as signals change.":"Best-ranked àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ right bayìí, updated as signals yípadà.","Big encouragement":"Big encouragement","Binary numbers":"Binary numbers","Bio":"Bio","Biology":"Biology","Block":"Dènà","Block/report abuse, scams or harassment and avoid sharing credentials or verification codes.":"Dènà/ròyìn abuse, scams tabi harassment ati avoid sharing credentials tabi verification codes.","Blocking uses SPIKE''s existing private-message protection and can remove the ability to interact with this member.":"Blocking uses SPIKE''s existing ìkọ̀kọ̀-ifiranṣẹ́ protection ati le yọ naa ability si interact pẹ̀lú èyí ọmọ ẹgbẹ́.","Boosts and premium presentation can increase visibility where offered, but they do not replace quality or guarantee a ranking position.":"Boosts ati premium presentation le increase ìfarahàn níbo offered, but they do not replace quality tabi guarantee kan ìpele position.","Both":"Méjèèjì","Browse Rooms to find communities that match your interests. Open a Room to learn more before joining.":"Browse Awọn yara si find àwùjọ pé match rẹ interests. Ṣí kan Yara si learn síi ṣáájú joining.","Browse a structured starting point for university study.":"Browse kan structured starting point fun university study.","Browse live communities and trending Rooms.":"Browse live àwùjọ ati trending Awọn yara.","Browse the Feed":"Browse naa Ìkànnì","Browse video-focused content.":"Browse video-focused àkóónú.","Browse your Feed, post an update, follow people, send a friend request, start a conversation or explore Rooms.":"Browse rẹ Ìkànnì, ìfìwéránṣẹ́ kan update, follow àwọn ènìyàn, ránṣẹ́ kan ọ̀rẹ́ request, bẹ̀rẹ̀ kan ìjíròrò tabi explore Awọn yara.","Browse, react, follow conversations and participate whenever you have something useful to add.":"Browse, react, follow àwọn ìjíròrò ati kópa whenever ẹ have something wúlò si add.","Browser notifications":"Àwáríàyé àwọn ìfitónilétí","Build an idea one response at a time.":"Build kan idea one response at kan àkókò.","Build personal Feeds from topics you choose.":"Build personal Feeds láti topics ẹ yan.","Build reputation through consistency":"Build reputation nipasẹ̀ consistency","Build your connections and discover people.":"Build rẹ connections ati ṣàwárí àwọn ènìyàn.","Build your progress":"Build rẹ ìlọsíwájú","Building SPIKE represents 9 years of experience, learning, persistence and dedication.":"Building SPIKE represents 9 years ti experience, learning, persistence ati dedication.","Built on SPIKE, not copied from another platform.":"Built lórí SPIKE, not copied láti another platform.","Business":"Business","CIRCLE CHAT":"CIRCLE CHAT","CONNECT • PASS • DISCOVER":"Sopọ̀ • PASS • Ṣàwárí","CONNECT • SHARE • DISCOVER":"SỌ́NÀ • PÍN • ṢÀWÁRÍ","CONTENTS":"CONTENTS","CREATE ROOM":"Ṣẹ̀dá Yara","CREATE ROOM ACCOUNT":"Ṣẹ̀dá Yara Akọọlẹ","CREATE YOUR SIGNAL":"Ṣẹ̀dá Rẹ Àmì","CREATOR":"Olùṣẹ̀dá","CSC 101":"CSC 101","CURRENT SEASON":"CURRENT SEASON","CURRENT STREAK":"CURRENT Ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí","Call supported friends, accept incoming calls, decline them, mute your microphone, toggle your camera and end the call.":"Ìpè ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn àwọn ọ̀rẹ́, gba incoming calls, kọ̀ them, mute rẹ microphone, toggle rẹ camera ati end naa ìpè.","Calling…":"Calling…","Calls":"Calls","Camera":"Camera","Can I improve my ranking by paying?":"Le I improve my ìpele by paying?","Cancel":"Fagilee","Canonical Policy Center":"Canonical Ìlànà Center","Carousel":"Carousel","Carry the message forward — with your own voice.":"Carry naa ifiranṣẹ́ forward — pẹ̀lú rẹ own ohùn.","Cases":"Àwọn ọ̀ràn","Catch up on your recent activity without reading every individual event.":"Catch sókè lórí rẹ recent iṣẹ́ without reading every individual event.","Category":"Category","Cell membranes":"Cell membranes","Cells & Life":"Cells & Life","Cells, genetics & life":"Cells, genetics & life","Chains":"Chains","Challenge":"ìpèníjà","Challenge a friend, choose a topic, set the duration, then let the community vote.":"Challenge kan ọ̀rẹ́, yan kan topic, set naa duration, then let naa àwùjọ vote.","Challenge a friend. Everyone else can vote.":"Challenge kan ọ̀rẹ́. Gbogbo ènìyàn else le vote.","Change control":"Yípadà control","Change cover":"Yípadà cover","Change profile picture":"Yípadà profaili picture","Change theme":"Yípadà akori","Changes apply after saving.":"Àwọn àyípadà apply after saving.","Changes are saved to your SPIKE account.":"Àwọn àyípadà jẹ fipamọ́ si rẹ SPIKE akọọlẹ.","Changes are saved to your SPIKE profile.":"Àwọn àyípadà jẹ fipamọ́ si rẹ SPIKE profaili.","Changes to enforcement-critical rules should be reviewed, logged and propagated to dependent moderation and recommendation systems before being treated as active.":"Àwọn àyípadà si enforcement-critical àwọn òfin should be reviewed, logged ati propagated si dependent ìṣàkóso ati recommendation systems ṣáájú being treated as ṣiṣẹ́.","Channel":"ikanni","Chat":"Chat","Chat in a Room":"Chat ní kan Yara","Check XP, achievements or streaks occasionally rather than obsessing over every point.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò XP, achievements tabi streaks occasionally rather than obsessing over every point.","Check in":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò ní","Check in once per day to maintain your streak. Eligible XP can receive a streak multiplier, and streak milestones can award bonus XP.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò ní once per day si maintain rẹ ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí. Yẹ XP le receive kan ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí multiplier, ati ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí milestones le award bonus XP.","Check in today":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò ní lónìí","Check in, complete daily tasks, earn XP, maintain a streak and unlock levels, ranks and achievements.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò ní, complete ojoojúmọ́ tasks, earn XP, maintain kan ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí ati unlock levels, ranks ati achievements.","Check in, review notifications, answer meaningful messages, and participate naturally.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò ní, àtúnyẹ̀wò àwọn ìfitónilétí, answer meaningful àwọn ifiranṣẹ́, ati kópa naturally.","Check spam/junk folders, make sure the email address is correct, and use the resend option after its cooldown. Only the newest valid code should be used.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò spam/junk folders, make sure naa imeeli address jẹ correct, ati lo naa resend option after its cooldown. Nikan naa newest valid kóòdù should be used.","Check that you have an eligible connection, a stable internet connection, and the required microphone/camera browser permissions.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ẹ have kan yẹ ìsopọ̀, kan stable internet ìsopọ̀, ati naa required microphone/camera àwáríàyé permissions.","Check your connection and refresh the conversation. If necessary, sign out and back in.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ ìsopọ̀ ati tún ṣe naa ìjíròrò. If necessary, wole out ati padà ní.","Check your connection, file type and size, then try again. If the issue continues, try an up-to-date browser.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ ìsopọ̀, file type ati size, then try again. If naa issue continues, try kan sókè-si-date àwáríàyé.","Check your connection, refresh the current page, and reopen the conversation or Room. Live presence can change as people connect or disconnect.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ ìsopọ̀, tún ṣe naa current ojúewé, ati reopen naa ìjíròrò tabi Yara. Live presence le yípadà as àwọn ènìyàn sopọ̀ tabi disconnect.","Check your connection, wait for the network to return, then retry. Avoid repeatedly submitting the same action while a connection is unstable.":"Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ ìsopọ̀, wait fun naa network si return, then gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kansi. Avoid repeatedly submitting naa same ìṣe while kan ìsopọ̀ jẹ unstable.","Checking profile access…":"Checking profaili ìwọlé…","Checking status…":"Checking ipo…","Checking your Room Account…":"Checking rẹ Yara Akọọlẹ…","Checking your creator activity.":"Checking rẹ olùṣẹ̀dá iṣẹ́.","Child safety":"Child ààbò","Child sexual exploitation and sexualization of minors are prohibited. Suspected material should be handled through the highest-safety moderation path and appropriate escalation procedures.":"Child sexual exploitation ati sexualization ti minors jẹ ewọ̀. Suspected material should be handled nipasẹ̀ naa highest-ààbò ìṣàkóso path ati appropriate escalation procedures.","Choose Public, Friends or Private visibility where supported.":"Yan Àgbàlá, Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ tabi Ìkọ̀kọ̀ ìfarahàn níbo ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn.","Choose a Room":"Yan kan Yara","Choose a channel, read the conversation and send messages. Replies, reactions and other actions appear when supported.":"Yan kan channel, read naa ìjíròrò ati ránṣẹ́ àwọn ifiranṣẹ́. Replies, reactions ati míràn àwọn ìṣe appear nígbà ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn.","Choose a clear title and explain the goal.":"Yan kan ko àkọlé ati explain naa goal.","Choose a friend":"Yan kan ọ̀rẹ́","Choose a friend.":"Yan kan ọ̀rẹ́.","Choose a friend…":"Yan kan ọ̀rẹ́…","Choose a username and add a profile picture and information you want people to see.":"Yan kan username ati add kan profaili picture ati alaye ẹ fẹ́ àwọn ènìyàn si see.","Choose an action for this media":"Yan kan ìṣe fun èyí àwọn mídíà","Choose cover photo":"Yan cover photo","Choose the duration and launch.":"Yan naa duration ati launch.","Choose the sign-up option on the welcome screen and follow the prompts. If you already have an account, simply sign in.":"Yan naa wole-sókè option lórí naa káàbọ̀ screen ati follow naa prompts. If ẹ already have kan akọọlẹ, simply wole ní.","Choose the video call option and allow camera access when your browser asks.":"Yan naa video ìpè option ati allow camera ìwọlé nígbà rẹ àwáríàyé asks.","Choose whether permitted people can see when you are online.":"Yan whether permitted àwọn ènìyàn le see nígbà ẹ jẹ lórí ayélujára.","Choose whether your profile can appear in discovery.":"Yan whether rẹ profaili le appear ní ìwádìí.","Choose who can call you: Everyone, Friends or Nobody.":"Yan ta le ìpè ẹ: Gbogbo ènìyàn, Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ tabi Nobody.","Choose who can see, discover and interact with you.":"Yan ta le see, ṣàwárí ati interact pẹ̀lú ẹ.","Choose who can start private conversations: Everyone, Friends or Nobody.":"Yan ta le bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìkọ̀kọ̀ àwọn ìjíròrò: Gbogbo ènìyàn, Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ tabi Nobody.","Choose your coffee":"Yan rẹ coffee","Choose your display name, email and password, agree to the displayed terms, then verify the email code.":"Yan rẹ display orúkọ, imeeli ati ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, agree si naa displayed àwọn òfin, then verify naa imeeli kóòdù.","Choose your goal":"Yan rẹ goal","Choose your path":"Yan rẹ path","Circle name":"Circle orúkọ","Circles":"Circles","Circles are for real community. Do not spam messages or manufacture activity for progression. Community value comes first.":"Circles jẹ fun real àwùjọ. Do not spam àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ tabi manufacture iṣẹ́ fun progression. Àwùjọ value comes first.","Classify":"Classify","Clean Sheet":"Clean Sheet","Clear":"Ko","Clear all":"Ko gbogbo","Clear explanations with practical examples.":"Ko explanations pẹ̀lú practical examples.","Clear selected media":"Ko selected àwọn mídíà","Clear, specific and enforceable":"Ko, specific ati enforceable","Close":"Pa","Close Feature Center":"Pa Feature Center","Close Friends":"Pa Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́","Close image viewer":"Pa image viewer","Close menu":"Pa menu","Close notification details":"Pa notification details","Close profile":"Pa profaili","Close scanner":"Pa scanner","Close story":"Pa ìtàn","Close textbook":"Pa textbook","Coins in wallets":"Coins ní wallets","Coins, Gems, revenue-gated earning, ranking, streaks, pool and monthly cashouts.":"Coins, Gems, revenue-gated earning, ìpele, streaks, pool ati monthly cashouts.","Collaborate":"Collaborate","Collaborative Signals":"Collaborative Signals","Collaborator user ID":"Collaborator olùmúlò Idánimọ̀","Collection":"Collection","Collections & bookmarks":"Collections & bookmarks","Comments":"àwọn asọye","Community Missions":"Àwùjọ Missions","Community activities":"Àwùjọ activities","Community conduct":"Àwùjọ conduct","Community voters choose one side. Participants cannot vote in their own Battle. Votes are protected server-side and the Battle closes according to its rules.":"Àwùjọ voters yan one side. Participants cannot vote ní their own Battle. Votes jẹ protected sàfà-side ati naa Battle closes according si its àwọn òfin.","Compare picks":"Compare picks","Complete all 11 qualification requirements to unlock the Creator Tool.":"Complete gbogbo 11 qualification requirements si unlock naa Olùṣẹ̀dá Tool.","Complete daily tasks, check in consistently, earn achievements and climb the level roadmap without farming activity.":"Complete ojoojúmọ́ tasks, ṣàyẹ̀wò ní consistently, earn achievements ati climb naa ipele roadmap without farming iṣẹ́.","Complete the displayed requirements":"Complete naa displayed requirements","Complete the requirements below to unlock Room creation.":"Complete naa requirements below si unlock Yara creation.","Complete the tasks shown in the Hub. Task names and rewards can change, so the live task card is the source of truth.":"Complete naa tasks shown ní naa Hub. Task names ati rewards le yípadà, so naa live task card jẹ naa source ti truth.","Complete useful daily tasks":"Complete wúlò ojoojúmọ́ tasks","Complete your profile":"Complete rẹ profaili","Computer Science":"Computer Science","Computing":"Computing","Confirm":"Jẹ́rìí","Confirm Email":"Jẹ́rìí Imeeli","Confirm action":"Jẹ́rìí ìṣe","Confirm new password":"Jẹ́rìí tuntun ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Confirm password":"Jẹ́rìí ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Confirm your email":"Jẹ́rìí rẹ imeeli","Connect":"Sopọ̀","Connect and participate":"Sopọ̀ ati kópa","Connect instantly. No request or approval required.":"Sopọ̀ instantly. Rárá request tabi approval required.","Connect people. Encourage expression. Give everyone a voice. Build something the world can acknowledge.":"Sopọ̀ àwọn ènìyàn. Encourage expression. Give gbogbo ènìyàn kan ohùn. Build something naa ayé le acknowledge.","Connect with people you actually want in your network. Follow up with meaningful conversation.":"Sopọ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ènìyàn ẹ actually fẹ́ ní rẹ network. Follow sókè pẹ̀lú meaningful ìjíròrò.","Connect • Share • Discover • Create • Participate • Grow":"Sopọ̀ • Pín • Ṣàwárí • Ṣẹ̀dá • Kópa • Grow","Connecting":"Connecting","Connecting to the canonical SPIKE Policy Core…":"Connecting si naa canonical SPIKE Ìlànà Core…","Connecting…":"Connecting…","Connection issue.":"Ìsopọ̀ issue.","Connection:":"Ìsopọ̀:","Connector":"Connector","Consistent rules, useful participation and respectful leadership":"Consistent àwọn òfin, wúlò participation ati respectful leadership","Contact":"Kan sí","Content":"Àkóónú","Content Admin":"Àkóónú Alákóso","Content Center":"Àkóónú Center","Content receiving the most activity.":"Àkóónú receiving naa most iṣẹ́.","Content restriction or removal":"Àkóónú restriction tabi removal","Content that creates serious safety risks may be removed immediately or escalated for review.":"Àkóónú pé creates serious ààbò risks le be removed immediately tabi escalated fun àtúnyẹ̀wò.","Context and proportionality":"Context ati proportionality","Continue":"Tẹ̀síwájú","Continue learning":"Tẹ̀síwájú learning","Continue to SPIKE":"Tẹ̀síwájú si SPIKE","Continue to room chat":"Tẹ̀síwájú si yara chat","Continue with GitHub":"Tẹ̀síwájú pẹ̀lú GitHub","Continue with Google":"Tẹ̀síwájú pẹ̀lú Google","Continue →":"Tẹ̀síwájú →","Contributor":"Contributor","Control center":"Control center","Control interactions":"Control interactions","Control who can see your posts":"Control ta le see rẹ àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́","Control who can view your connections.":"Control ta le wo rẹ connections.","Control who can view your posts and profile media.":"Control ta le wo rẹ àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ ati profaili àwọn mídíà.","Controls whether your presence is published to SPIKE.":"Controls whether rẹ presence jẹ published si SPIKE.","Conversation filters":"Ìjíròrò filters","Coordinated spam, artificial engagement, automated abuse, recommendation manipulation and attempts to evade enforcement are prohibited.":"Coordinated spam, artificial engagement, automated abuse, recommendation manipulation ati attempts si evade enforcement jẹ ewọ̀.","Copy":"Ẹ̀dà","Copy SP ID":"Ẹ̀dà SP Idánimọ̀","Copyright":"Copyright","Correct Score":"Correct Score","Course":"Ẹ̀kọ́","Courses":"Àwọn ẹ̀kọ́","Courses & GPA":"Àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ & GPA","Cover image":"Cover image","Create":"Ṣẹ̀dá","Create A Room":"Ṣẹ̀dá Kan Yara","Create Account":"Ṣẹ̀dá akọọlẹ","Create Circle":"Ṣẹ̀dá Circle","Create Custom Feed":"Ṣẹ̀dá Custom Ìkànnì","Create Membership":"Ṣẹ̀dá Membership","Create Poll":"Ṣẹ̀dá Poll","Create Product":"Ṣẹ̀dá Product","Create Signal Series":"Ṣẹ̀dá Àmì Series","Create a Room":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan Yara","Create a new password":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan tuntun ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Create a post":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan ìfìwéránṣẹ́","Create a private Circle for invited friends or a discoverable Circle anyone can join. Owners can invite friends; members can open the Circle chat.":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan ìkọ̀kọ̀ Circle fun invited àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ tabi kan discoverable Circle anyone le darapọ̀. Owners le invite àwọn ọ̀rẹ́; àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ le ṣí naa Circle chat.","Create a real Supabase Auth account from the Admin Center. The service credential never enters this browser.":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan real Supabase Auth akọọlẹ láti naa Alákóso Center. Naa service credential never enters èyí àwáríàyé.","Create a shared project with other SPIKE users. The collaboration layer is intentionally separate from ordinary posts and Rooms.":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan shared project pẹ̀lú míràn SPIKE àwọn olùmúlò. Naa collaboration layer jẹ intentionally separate láti ordinary àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ ati Awọn yara.","Create a strong password":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan strong ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Create account":"Ṣẹ̀dá akọọlẹ","Create an account":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan akọọlẹ","Create an update and, where supported, add photos, videos, audio or links. Use the audience options shown before sharing.":"Ṣẹ̀dá kan update ati, níbo ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn, add photos, videos, audio tabi links. Lo naa audience options shown ṣáájú sharing.","Create and feature rooms from this panel.":"Ṣẹ̀dá ati feature awọn yara láti èyí panel.","Create and manage the communities you own.":"Ṣẹ̀dá ati ṣàkóso naa àwùjọ ẹ own.","Create one shared goal, choose a fixed XP difficulty tier, then work toward SPIKE''s server-defined target before the deadline. Progress must reflect a real contribution.":"Ṣẹ̀dá one shared goal, yan kan fixed XP difficulty tier, then work toward SPIKE''s sàfà-defined ìfojúsùn ṣáájú naa deadline. Ìlọsíwájú must reflect kan real contribution.","Create story":"Ṣẹ̀dá ìtàn","Create your Room":"Ṣẹ̀dá rẹ Yara","Create your Room Account":"Ṣẹ̀dá rẹ Yara Akọọlẹ","Create your account":"Ṣẹ̀dá rẹ akọọlẹ","Create, feature, activate and deactivate Rooms.":"Ṣẹ̀dá, feature, activate ati deactivate Awọn yara.","Creating a Room":"Creating kan Yara","Creating or using accounts, content or technical mechanisms primarily to evade a valid SPIKE enforcement action may result in additional restrictions.":"Creating tabi using accounts, àkóónú tabi technical mechanisms primarily si evade kan valid SPIKE enforcement ìṣe le result ní additional restrictions.","Creator":"Olùṣẹ̀dá","Creator Memberships & Store":"Olùṣẹ̀dá Memberships & Store","Creator Qualification Challenge":"Olùṣẹ̀dá Qualification Challenge","Creator Store":"Olùṣẹ̀dá Store","Creator insight":"Olùṣẹ̀dá insight","Creator path":"Olùṣẹ̀dá path","Creator qualification":"Olùṣẹ̀dá qualification","Critical":"Critical","Current mastery":"Current mastery","Custom Feeds":"Custom Feeds","Custom amount (₦)":"Custom amount (₦)","DNA":"DNA","Daily":"Ojoojúmọ́","Daily Missions":"Ojoojúmọ́ Missions","Daily activity in this period":"Ojoojúmọ́ iṣẹ́ ní èyí period","Daily check-in":"Ojoojúmọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò-ní","Daily learning":"Ojoojúmọ́ learning","Daily tasks":"Ojoojúmọ́ tasks","Dashboard":"Dashboard","Day study streak":"Day study ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí","Decision records":"Decision records","Decline":"Kọ̀","Delete message":"Pa ifiranṣẹ́","Delete read":"Pa read","Delete story":"Pa ìtàn","Delete the entire room":"Pa naa entire yara","Delete this message?":"Pa èyí ifiranṣẹ́?","Depending on the Room, you may find polls, events, announcements, moments, rules and member information.":"Depending lórí naa Yara, ẹ le find ìdìbò, events, announcements, moments, àwọn òfin ati ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ alaye.","Description":"Àpèjúwe","Desert Rose":"Desert Rose","Design rules":"Design àwọn òfin","Detect":"Detect","Different for every member":"Different fun every ọmọ ẹgbẹ́","Digital":"Digital","Disable Maintenance":"Pa Maintenance","Discover":"Ṣàwárí","Discover People":"Ṣàwárí Àwọn ènìyàn","Discover Rooms":"Ṣàwárí Awọn yara","Discover people":"Ṣàwárí àwọn ènìyàn","Discover people, build genuine connections, message friends and participate in Rooms.":"Ṣàwárí àwọn ènìyàn, build genuine connections, ifiranṣẹ́ àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ ati kópa ní Awọn yara.","Discover registered SPIKE people you may want to connect with.":"Ṣàwárí registered SPIKE àwọn ènìyàn ẹ le fẹ́ si sopọ̀ pẹ̀lú.","Discoverable — anyone can join":"Discoverable — anyone le darapọ̀","Dismiss":"Dismiss","Dismissed":"Dismissed","Display name":"Display orúkọ","Distribute the accumulated 15% pool to active users by streak multiplier.":"Distribute naa accumulated 15% pool si ṣiṣẹ́ àwọn olùmúlò by ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí multiplier.","Distribute today":"Distribute lónìí","Do not assume every action earns XP. Rewards and limits can change as SPIKE evolves, and server-side rules are authoritative.":"Do not assume every ìṣe earns XP. Rewards ati limits le yípadà as SPIKE evolves, ati sàfà-side àwọn òfin jẹ authoritative.","Do not coordinate fake accounts, spam voting, or attempt to manipulate the result. Repeated voting does not create unlimited progression.":"Do not coordinate fake accounts, spam voting, tabi attempt si manipulate naa result. Repeated voting does not ṣẹ̀dá unlimited progression.","Do not spam fake progress, automate clicks, create trivial high-tier challenges, or use multiple accounts to manufacture progression. SPIKE enforces reward tiers and mission difficulty on the server.":"Do not spam fake ìlọsíwájú, automate clicks, ṣẹ̀dá trivial gíga-tier challenges, tabi lo multiple accounts si manufacture progression. SPIKE enforces reward tiers ati mission difficulty lórí naa sàfà.","Double Chance":"Double Chance","Download story media":"Download ìtàn àwọn mídíà","Doxxing and privacy abuse":"Doxxing ati ìpamọ́ abuse","Draft stays on this device until you release it.":"Draft stays lórí èyí device until ẹ release it.","Drafts":"Àwọn àkótán","Drafts & scheduling":"Àwọn àkótán & scheduling","Draw No Bet":"Draw Rárá Bet","During a call":"During kan ìpè","EDU":"EDU","ELECHI OSOUNDU JOSHUA":"ELECHI OSOUNDU JOSHUA","ENGLISH":"ENGLISH","Each published policy revision receives a version identifier and effective date. Moderation decisions reference the version that governed the decision.":"Each published ìlànà revision receives kan version identifier ati effective date. Ìṣàkóso decisions reference naa version pé governed naa decision.","Earn Room XP through messages, reactions, challenges and community activity.":"Earn Yara XP nipasẹ̀ àwọn ifiranṣẹ́, reactions, challenges ati àwùjọ iṣẹ́.","Earn XP":"Earn XP","Earn badges through real SPIKE activity.":"Earn badges nipasẹ̀ real SPIKE iṣẹ́.","Earn progress":"Earn ìlọsíwájú","Easy":"Rọrùn","Edit":"Ṣàtúnṣe","Edit only verified requirements. No manual completion control exists here.":"Ṣàtúnṣe nikan verified requirements. Rárá manual completion control exists here.","Edit profile":"Ṣàtúnṣe profaili","Edit your profile":"Ṣàtúnṣe rẹ profaili","Eligible activity can award XP, while streaks and tasks can add structured progression.":"Yẹ iṣẹ́ le award XP, while streaks ati tasks le add structured progression.","Eligible users can challenge an enforcement decision through the SPIKE appeal workflow.":"Yẹ àwọn olùmúlò le challenge kan enforcement decision nipasẹ̀ naa SPIKE ẹ̀bẹ̀ workflow.","Elite":"Elite","Email":"Imeeli","Email address":"Imeeli address","Emerald Atelier":"Emerald Atelier","Emoji":"Emoji","Enable":"Mú ṣiṣẹ́","Enable Maintenance":"Mú ṣiṣẹ́ Maintenance","Encouraging, glorifying or facilitating self-harm or suicide is prohibited. Supportive discussion and requests for help are not treated as equivalent to encouragement.":"Encouraging, glorifying tabi facilitating self-harm tabi suicide jẹ ewọ̀. Supportive discussion ati àwọn ìbéèrè fun ìrànlọ́wọ́ jẹ not treated as equivalent si encouragement.","Encrypted session":"Encrypted session","End call":"End ìpè","End this session on this device.":"End èyí session lórí èyí device.","Ends at (optional)":"Ends at (àṣàyàn)","Enforcement":"Enforcement","Enforcement & appeals":"Enforcement & appeals","Enforcement cases":"Enforcement àwọn ọ̀ràn","Enforcement evasion":"Enforcement evasion","Enforcement is tied to the policy violation and the severity, confidence and history of the case.":"Enforcement jẹ tied si naa ìlànà violation ati naa severity, ìgboyà ati history ti naa ọ̀ràn.","Engagement":"Engagement","Engagement controls":"Engagement controls","Engagement totals":"Engagement totals","Engagement trend":"Engagement trend","Engineering":"Engineering","English Language":"English Èdè","Enter the newest code from your SPIKE email. Codes are temporary and can only be used once.":"Enter naa newest kóòdù láti rẹ SPIKE imeeli. Codes jẹ temporary ati le nikan be used once.","Enter your email and password, or use an available social sign-in option. Passwords are case-sensitive.":"Enter rẹ imeeli ati ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, tabi lo kan wà social wole-ní option. Passwords jẹ ọ̀ràn-sensitive.","Enter your email and we''ll send a secure recovery link.":"Enter rẹ imeeli ati we''ll ránṣẹ́ kan ààbò múpadàbọ̀sípò ọ̀nà asopọ̀.","Epic":"Epic","Every award is recorded server-side.":"Every award jẹ recorded sàfà-side.","Every broadcast is queued, batched, and audited.":"Every broadcast jẹ queued, batched, ati audited.","Every cash-purchasable feature is submitted here as a request. Contact the user on WhatsApp, send the official bank details, verify the payment transaction, then approve to unlock or credit the purchase.":"Every cash-purchasable feature jẹ submitted here as kan request. Kan sí naa olùmúlò lórí WhatsApp, ránṣẹ́ naa official bank details, verify naa payment transaction, then approve si unlock tabi credit naa purchase.","Every enforcement action should retain its policy ID, policy version, action, decision source, timestamp and sufficient evidence for authorized review.":"Every enforcement ìṣe should retain its ìlànà Idánimọ̀, ìlànà version, ìṣe, decision source, timestamp ati sufficient evidence fun authorized àtúnyẹ̀wò.","Every mission must declare a metric + target. Progress is read from genuine message, Signal, Room, membership and Echo records. Completion is automatic. Weekly rewards are one-time per member/challenge. Achievements are one-time and server-unlocked.":"Every mission must declare kan metric + ìfojúsùn. Ìlọsíwájú jẹ read láti genuine ifiranṣẹ́, Àmì, Yara, membership ati Echo records. Completion jẹ automatic. Ọ̀sẹ̀ọ̀sẹ̀ rewards jẹ one-àkókò per ọmọ ẹgbẹ́/challenge. Achievements jẹ one-àkókò ati sàfà-unlocked.","Everyone":"Gbogbo ènìyàn","Everyone here can participate. Keep the conversation respectful.":"Gbogbo ènìyàn here le kópa. Pa mọ́ naa ìjíròrò respectful.","Everything you need to get the most out of SPIKE.":"Everything ẹ níláti si get naa most out ti SPIKE.","Everything you need, one tap away.":"Everything ẹ níláti, one tap away.","Exam preparation":"Exam preparation","Existing Rooms are surfaced with current activity context.":"Existing Awọn yara jẹ surfaced pẹ̀lú current iṣẹ́ context.","Expand all":"Expand gbogbo","Explain the context and why you believe the enforcement was incorrect.":"Explain naa context ati kí ló dé ẹ believe naa enforcement was incorrect.","Explain the decision.":"Explain naa decision.","Explore":"Explore","Explore connected topics":"Explore connected topics","Explore courses →":"Explore àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ →","Explore people, posts and topics beyond your usual feed.":"Explore àwọn ènìyàn, àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ ati topics beyond rẹ usual ìkànnì.","Explore personalized, discovery and trending content. Available feed views and sorting options help you find the posts you care about.":"Explore personalized, ìwádìí ati trending àkóónú. Wà ìkànnì àwọn ìwò ati sorting options ìrànlọ́wọ́ ẹ find naa àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ ẹ care nípa.","Explore profiles, suggestions and the Friends area to discover people you know or want to connect with.":"Explore profiles, suggestions ati naa Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ area si ṣàwárí àwọn ènìyàn ẹ know tabi fẹ́ si sopọ̀ pẹ̀lú.","Explore relationships between your activity, communities and future discovery.":"Explore relationships between rẹ iṣẹ́, àwùjọ ati future ìwádìí.","Explore the Feed":"Explore naa Ìkànnì","Explorer":"Explorer","FAQ":"FAQ","FIXTURES":"FIXTURES","Fair play":"Ere tó tọ́","Fair play and limits":"Dáadáa ere ati limits","Feed":"Ìkànnì","Feed & Stories":"Ìkànnì & Àwọn ìtàn","Feed & discovery":"Ìkànnì & ìwádìí","Feed controls":"Ìkànnì controls","Feed is for discovering and sharing; Messages are for private conversation; Rooms are for communities; Profile is for identity; Leveling is for progress.":"Ìkànnì jẹ fun discovering ati sharing; Àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ jẹ fun ìkọ̀kọ̀ ìjíròrò; Awọn yara jẹ fun àwùjọ; Profaili jẹ fun ìdánimọ̀; Leveling jẹ fun ìlọsíwájú.","Feed name":"Ìkànnì orúkọ","Finance Admin":"Finance Alákóso","Find account":"Find akọọlẹ","Find an answer fast":"Find kan answer fast","Find communities and join the conversation.":"Find àwùjọ ati darapọ̀ naa ìjíròrò.","Find content receiving strong current attention.":"Find àkóónú receiving strong current attention.","Find people":"Find àwọn ènìyàn","Find people, send friend requests, join Rooms, comment, react and message your connections.":"Find àwọn ènìyàn, ránṣẹ́ ọ̀rẹ́ àwọn ìbéèrè, darapọ̀ Awọn yara, comment, react ati ifiranṣẹ́ rẹ connections.","Find people, t