cy Center":"Ìlànà Center","Policy Core":"Ìlànà Core","Policy ID":"Ìlànà Idánimọ̀","Policy IDs are stable references":"Ìlànà IDs jẹ stable references","Policy IDs shown here are canonical references for future SPIKE moderation, recommendation-safety, notification, appeal and administration systems. This page is the canonical SPIKE policy reference. Enforcement is implemented server-side and this page does not replace applicable law or the SPIKE Terms of Service.":"Ìlànà IDs shown here jẹ canonical references fun future SPIKE ìṣàkóso, recommendation-ààbò, notification, ẹ̀bẹ̀ ati administration systems. Èyí ojúewé jẹ naa canonical SPIKE ìlànà reference. Enforcement jẹ implemented sàfà-side ati èyí ojúewé does not replace applicable law tabi naa SPIKE Àwọn òfin ti Service.","Policy changes":"Ìlànà àwọn àyípadà","Policy changes must be versioned so historical decisions remain interpretable.":"Ìlànà àwọn àyípadà must be versioned so historical decisions remain interpretable.","Policy moderation sections":"Ìlànà ìṣàkóso sections","Policy sections":"Ìlànà sections","Policy version 1.0":"Ìlànà version 1.0","Polish":"Polish","Polish a draft, add a hook, shorten it or suggest hashtags.":"Polish kan draft, add kan hook, shorten it tabi suggest hashtags.","Polls":"Ìdìbò","Popular":"Popular","Possible actions":"Possible àwọn ìṣe","Post IDs, comma separated":"Ìfìwéránṣẹ́ IDs, comma separated","Post ideas, stories, media or links that give people a reason to stop, read and return.":"Ìfìwéránṣẹ́ ideas, àwọn ìtàn, àwọn mídíà tabi links pé give àwọn ènìyàn kan reason si stop, read ati return.","Post image":"Ìfìwéránṣẹ́ image","Post, connect and participate to grow your profile.":"Ìfìwéránṣẹ́, sopọ̀ ati kópa si grow rẹ profaili.","Post, connect, converse, join communities and complete useful tasks.":"Ìfìwéránṣẹ́, sopọ̀, converse, darapọ̀ àwùjọ ati complete wúlò tasks.","Posts":"Àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́","Posts & media":"Àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ & àwọn mídíà","Posts visibility":"Àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ ìfarahàn","Posts, media & stories":"Àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́, àwọn mídíà & àwọn ìtàn","Power the build":"Power naa build","Predict smarter. Follow every fixture.":"Predict smarter. Follow every fixture.","Prediction markets":"Prediction markets","Predictions & matches":"Predictions & matches","Predictions are model estimates, not guarantees. Missing fixtures or markets simply means the relevant data is not currently available.":"Predictions jẹ model estimates, not guarantees. Missing fixtures tabi markets simply means naa relevant data jẹ not currently wà.","Predictions can be wrong. Treat confidence as information, not certainty, and never risk money you cannot afford to lose.":"Predictions le be wrong. Treat ìgboyà as alaye, not certainty, ati never risk money ẹ cannot afford si lose.","Predictor":"Asọtẹ́lẹ̀","Prefer quality posts and genuine relationships over repetitive engagement.":"Prefer quality àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ ati genuine relationships over repetitive engagement.","Preparing your sign-in experience…":"Preparing rẹ wole-ní experience…","Preview selected media, add more items, rotate, filter, crop, mute video and choose a layout.":"Preview selected àwọn mídíà, add síi items, rotate, filter, crop, mute video ati yan kan layout.","Previous":"Previous","Previous image":"Previous image","Previous story":"Previous ìtàn","Price in Coins":"Price ní Coins","Principles":"Principles","Print":"Print","Prioritize thoughtful introductions and relationships rather than collecting connections for a number.":"Prioritize thoughtful introductions ati relationships rather than collecting connections fun kan number.","Privacy":"Ìpamọ́","Privacy & Access":"Ìpamọ́ & Ìwọlé","Privacy & access":"Ìpamọ́ & ìwọlé","Privacy & protection":"Ìpamọ́ & protection","Privacy & safety":"Ìpamọ́ & ààbò","Privacy settings reduce exposure; they cannot control what another person does with information you voluntarily send them. Think before sharing passwords, codes, financial details, private documents or sensitive personal information.":"Ìpamọ́ ètò reduce exposure; they cannot control kí another person does pẹ̀lú alaye ẹ voluntarily ránṣẹ́ them. Think ṣáájú sharing passwords, codes, financial details, ìkọ̀kọ̀ documents tabi sensitive personal alaye.","Private":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀","Private Circles are invitation-only. Discoverable Circles can be joined by eligible users.":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ Circles jẹ invitation-nikan. Discoverable Circles le be darapọ̀ by yẹ àwọn olùmúlò.","Private Messages":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ Àwọn ifiranṣẹ́","Private audience":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ audience","Private communications":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ communications","Private information":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ alaye","Private message":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ ifiranṣẹ́","Private messages":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ àwọn ifiranṣẹ́","Private messages and private community data should not be exposed through public recommendation, search or administrative interfaces except where an authorized safety or legal workflow requires access.":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ ati ìkọ̀kọ̀ àwùjọ data should not be exposed nipasẹ̀ àgbàlá recommendation, wá tabi administrative interfaces except níbo kan authorized ààbò tabi legal workflow requires ìwọlé.","Private messaging is designed for one-to-one conversations with your friends and supported connections.":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ messaging jẹ designed fun one-si-one àwọn ìjíròrò pẹ̀lú rẹ àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ ati ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn connections.","Private to the profile owner.":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ si naa profaili owner.","Private vs discoverable":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ vs discoverable","Private — invite friends":"Ìkọ̀kọ̀ — invite àwọn ọ̀rẹ́","Product title":"Product àkọlé","Profile":"Profaili","Profile discovery":"Profaili ìwádìí","Profile keeps loading":"Profaili keeps ń gbé","Profile options":"Profaili options","Profile views":"Profaili àwọn ìwò","Profile visibility":"Ìfarahàn profaili","Profiles":"àwọn profaili","Progress is calculated from real activity.":"Ìlọsíwájú jẹ calculated láti real iṣẹ́.","Progress is computed from real activity during the challenge window.":"Ìlọsíwájú jẹ computed láti real iṣẹ́ during naa challenge fèrèsé.","Progression follows authoritative XP thresholds.":"Progression follows authoritative XP thresholds.","Progression loop":"Progression loop","Prohibited catalog":"Ewọ̀ catalog","Prohibited term catalog":"Ewọ̀ term catalog","Prohibited words and phrases":"Ewọ̀ words ati phrases","Protect your account":"Protect rẹ akọọlẹ","Protected recovery":"Protected múpadàbọ̀sípò","Public":"Àgbàlá","Public Rooms are community spaces. Follow the displayed rules, avoid spam/scams/harassment, and use report tools when something genuinely violates the rules.":"Àgbàlá Awọn yara jẹ àwùjọ spaces. Follow naa displayed àwọn òfin, avoid spam/scams/harassment, ati lo ròyìn tools nígbà something genuinely violates naa àwọn òfin.","Public identity on SPIKE":"Àgbàlá ìdánimọ̀ lórí SPIKE","Public posts":"Àgbàlá àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́","Publicly shame the reporter":"Publicly shame naa reporter","Publish":"Publish","Publish Mission":"Publish iṣẹ́","Publish consistently, improve your profile, learn what your audience values and build a recognizable voice.":"Publish consistently, improve rẹ profaili, learn kí rẹ audience values ati build kan recognizable ohùn.","Publish only when the goal is clear and achievable.":"Publish nikan nígbà naa goal jẹ ko ati achievable.","Publish something useful, answer a question, help in a Room or have a genuine conversation.":"Publish something wúlò, answer kan question, ìrànlọ́wọ́ ní kan Yara tabi have kan genuine ìjíròrò.","Published":"Published","Publishing or soliciting highly sensitive personal information for harassment, intimidation or harm is prohibited.":"Publishing tabi soliciting highly sensitive personal alaye fun harassment, intimidation tabi harm jẹ ewọ̀.","Publishing your story…":"Publishing rẹ ìtàn…","Put something into the world. Make it worth hearing.":"Put something into naa ayé. Make it worth hearing.","QR connection":"QR ìsopọ̀","QUICK HELP":"QUICK Ìrànlọ́wọ́","Quality beats volume. A clear idea, useful caption and relevant media usually create a better experience than posting repeatedly just to increase activity.":"Quality beats volume. Kan ko idea, wúlò caption ati relevant àwọn mídíà usually ṣẹ̀dá kan better experience than posting repeatedly just si increase iṣẹ́.","Quality test:":"Quality test:","Queue & Send":"Queue & Ránṣẹ́","Quick actions for this profile.":"Quick àwọn ìṣe fun èyí profaili.","Quick answers when something doesn''t go as expected.":"Quick answers nígbà something doesn''t go as expected.","Quick check":"Quick ṣàyẹ̀wò","Quick coffee":"Quick coffee","Quick links":"Quick links","Quick review":"Quick àtúnyẹ̀wò","RELEASE":"RELEASE","ROOM":"Yara","ROOMS ADMIN":"Awọn yara Alákóso","Rank":"Rank","Ranked by confidence":"Ranked by ìgboyà","Ranking & visibility":"Ìpele & ìfarahàn","React, Echo, Pass and Keep Signals using the actions shown on each Signal.":"React, Echo, Pass ati Pa mọ́ Signals using naa àwọn ìṣe shown lórí each Àmì.","Reactions":"Reactions","Read the existing entries, then add a meaningful continuation. Entries keep their parent-child relationship so the history stays understandable.":"Read naa existing entries, then add kan meaningful continuation. Entries pa mọ́ their parent-child relationship so naa history stays understandable.","Ready to preview":"Ready si preview","Ready when your voice is ready.":"Ready nígbà rẹ ohùn jẹ ready.","Recalculate levels":"Recalculate levels","Recent Broadcasts":"Recent Broadcasts","Recent room activity will appear here when activity data is available.":"Recent yara iṣẹ́ will appear here nígbà iṣẹ́ data jẹ wà.","Recommendation systems must apply policy safety before ranking content for distribution.":"Recommendation systems must apply ìlànà ààbò ṣáájú ìpele àkóónú fun distribution.","Recommendations":"Recommendations","Recommended next":"Recommended tókàn","Recommended pipeline: publish/edit → server moderation → remove or review when required → privacy/access checks → personal mute filtering → candidate generation → safety eligibility → ranking → feed.":"Recommended pipeline: publish/ṣàtúnṣe → sàfà ìṣàkóso → yọ tabi àtúnyẹ̀wò nígbà required → ìpamọ́/ìwọlé checks → personal mute filtering → candidate generation → ààbò eligibility → ìpele → ìkànnì.","Recommended safety behavior":"Recommended ààbò behavior","Record a voice note, review the recording state, cancel if needed, and send.":"Record kan ohùn note, àtúnyẹ̀wò naa recording state, fagilee if needed, ati ránṣẹ́.","Recording voice note…":"Recording ohùn note…","Recover a member only with their current Personal Safety Code. Verification and recovery authorization are server-controlled.":"Recover kan ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ nikan pẹ̀lú their current Personal Ààbò Kóòdù. Verification ati múpadàbọ̀sípò authorization jẹ sàfà-controlled.","Recovery link":"Múpadàbọ̀sípò ọ̀nà asopọ̀","Recruitment, operational support, credible praise intended to advance violent extremist activity and instructions that facilitate violent extremist acts are prohibited.":"Recruitment, operational support, credible praise intended si advance violent extremist iṣẹ́ ati instructions pé facilitate violent extremist acts jẹ ewọ̀.","Refresh":"Tún ṣe","Refresh Top Picks":"Tún ṣe Top Picks","Refresh admins":"Tún ṣe admins","Refresh engagement":"Tún ṣe engagement","Refresh intelligence":"Tún ṣe intelligence","Refresh notifications":"Tún ṣe àwọn ìfitónilétí","Refresh room":"Tún ṣe yara","Refresh the Gamification Hub. Progress is authoritative to the live gamification system, so do not rely on a manually calculated total.":"Tún ṣe naa Gamification Hub. Ìlọsíwájú jẹ authoritative si naa live gamification ètò, so do not rely lórí kan manually calculated total.","Refresh the Notifications page. If SPIKE asks you to sign in again, your saved session may no longer be valid.":"Tún ṣe naa Àwọn ìfitónilétí ojúewé. If SPIKE asks ẹ si wole ní again, rẹ fipamọ́ session le rárá longer be valid.","Registration is owner-only. The new account automatically receives its SPIKE profile, wallet and generated SP_ID through the existing Auth triggers.":"Registration jẹ owner-nikan. Naa tuntun akọọlẹ automatically receives its SPIKE profaili, wallet ati generated SP_Idánimọ̀ nipasẹ̀ naa existing Auth triggers.","Rejected":"Rejected","Release time":"Release àkókò","Remember me":"Remember èmi","Remember what the model means":"Remember kí naa model means","Remove":"Yọ","Remove, restrict or review.":"Yọ, restrict tabi àtúnyẹ̀wò.","Removed or restricted content must not enter recommendation candidates. Policy eligibility is checked before personalization and ranking signals are applied.":"Removed tabi restricted àkóónú must not enter recommendation candidates. Ìlànà eligibility jẹ checked ṣáájú personalization ati ìpele signals jẹ applied.","Repeat infringement":"Repeat infringement","Repeat your new password":"Repeat rẹ tuntun ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Repeat your password":"Repeat rẹ ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Repeated valid copyright violations may result in escalating account enforcement under applicable law and SPIKE''s terms.":"Repeated valid copyright violations le result ní escalating akọọlẹ enforcement under applicable law ati SPIKE''s àwọn òfin.","Reply":"Reply","Reply to a message and follow conversation threads.":"Reply si kan ifiranṣẹ́ ati follow ìjíròrò threads.","Reply, react, edit supported messages, pin, save/unsave, translate, copy, delete and report.":"Reply, react, ṣàtúnṣe ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn àwọn ifiranṣẹ́, dábàá, fipamọ́/unsave, túmọ̀, ẹ̀dà, pa ati ròyìn.","Report":"Ròyìn","Report Signal":"Ròyìn Àmì","Report Signals, messages or Room content when appropriate. You can also block users. In Rooms, follow the displayed rules and use moderation/report flows rather than escalating conflict.":"Ròyìn Signals, àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ tabi Yara àkóónú nígbà appropriate. Ẹ le also dènà àwọn olùmúlò. Ní Awọn yara, follow naa displayed àwọn òfin ati lo ìṣàkóso/ròyìn flows rather than escalating conflict.","Report content":"Ròyìn àkóónú","Report inappropriate posts, profiles, messages or Room activity using the relevant report control.":"Ròyìn inappropriate àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́, profiles, àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ tabi Yara iṣẹ́ using naa relevant ròyìn control.","Report message":"Ròyìn ifiranṣẹ́","Reputation":"Reputation","Reputation, discovery, memory & insights":"Reputation, ìwádìí, memory & insights","Resend Code":"Resend Kóòdù","Reset":"Tún ṣe","Reset your password":"Tún ṣe rẹ ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Resource":"Resource","Respect the Room":"Respect naa Yara","Respond to the people and conversations that actually deserve your attention.":"Respond si naa àwọn ènìyàn ati àwọn ìjíròrò pé actually deserve rẹ attention.","Restored":"Restored","Restrict":"Restrict","Resume":"Tẹ̀síwájú","Resume Center":"Tẹ̀síwájú Center","Retest anytime":"Retest anytime","Retry":"Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kansi","Return to Rooms you already joined.":"Return si Awọn yara ẹ already darapọ̀.","Return to unfinished SPIKE work without losing your place.":"Return si unfinished SPIKE work without losing rẹ place.","Revenue today":"Revenue lónìí","Review":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò","Review Policy":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò Ìlànà","Review Settings after major changes to your life, audience or comfort level.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò Ètò after major àwọn àyípadà si rẹ life, audience tabi comfort ipele.","Review automated SPIKE Policy actions, see the policy reference attached to each case, and submit one active appeal per enforcement case.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò automated SPIKE Ìlànà àwọn ìṣe, see naa ìlànà reference attached si each ọ̀ràn, ati submit one ṣiṣẹ́ ẹ̀bẹ̀ per enforcement ọ̀ràn.","Review drafts, scheduled content and published performance.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò àwọn àkótán, scheduled àkóónú ati published performance.","Review incoming requests and accept or decline them. You can also manage requests you have sent.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò incoming àwọn ìbéèrè ati gba tabi kọ̀ them. Ẹ le also ṣàkóso àwọn ìbéèrè ẹ have sent.","Review mentions, social activity, connection activity and other account events.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò mentions, social iṣẹ́, ìsopọ̀ iṣẹ́ ati míràn akọọlẹ events.","Review notifications":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò àwọn ìfitónilétí","Review pending requests and accept or decline them.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò pending àwọn ìbéèrè ati gba tabi kọ̀ them.","Review pending user appeals without exposing moderation internals to clients.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò pending olùmúlò appeals without exposing ìṣàkóso internals si clients.","Review removals, holds and restoration decisions.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò removals, holds ati restoration decisions.","Review states":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò states","Review the model''s projected score, confidence information and available markets before deciding what to save.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò naa model''s projected score, ìgboyà alaye ati wà markets ṣáájú deciding kí si fipamọ́.","Review weak areas":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò weak areas","Review your live qualification status.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò rẹ live qualification ipo.","Review your profile, clean saved items, join useful Room discussions and check your progress.":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò rẹ profaili, clean fipamọ́ items, darapọ̀ wúlò Yara discussions ati ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ ìlọsíwájú.","Review your progress":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò rẹ ìlọsíwájú","Rights to uploaded material":"Rights si uploaded material","Role":"Ipa","Room":"Yara","Room Account":"Yara Akọọlẹ","Room Guide":"Yara Ìtọ́sọ́nà","Room ID:":"Yara Idánimọ̀:","Room Moments":"Yara Moments","Room activity":"Yara iṣẹ́","Room channels":"Yara channels","Room chat":"Yara chat","Room cover":"Yara cover","Room creation":"Yara creation","Room creation is a creator feature. The Creator area shows your live qualification progress and the requirements needed to unlock the Creator Tool, including an account-age requirement and a creator challenge. The exact live checklist shown in the app is authoritative.":"Yara creation jẹ kan olùṣẹ̀dá feature. Naa Olùṣẹ̀dá area shows rẹ live qualification ìlọsíwájú ati naa requirements needed si unlock naa Olùṣẹ̀dá Tool, including kan akọọlẹ-age requirement ati kan olùṣẹ̀dá challenge. Naa exact live checklist shown ní naa app jẹ authoritative.","Room feature requests":"Yara feature àwọn ìbéèrè","Room handle":"Yara handle","Room information":"Ya