tic blocking nígbà naa rule jẹ unambiguous, tabi contextual àtúnyẹ̀wò nígbà meaning depends lórí surrounding àkóónú.","SPIKE may restrict or remove content that falls within defined prohibited categories.":"SPIKE le restrict tabi yọ àkóónú pé falls within defined ewọ̀ categories.","SPIKE member":"SPIKE ọmọ ẹgbẹ́","SPIKE navigation":"SPIKE navigation","SPIKE new features":"SPIKE tuntun features","SPIKE profile":"SPIKE profaili","SPIKE sets the challenge target and time window for that tier.":"SPIKE sets naa challenge ìfojúsùn ati àkókò fèrèsé fun pé tier.","SPIKE should prioritize user safety while minimizing unnecessary removals, discriminatory enforcement and avoidable false positives.":"SPIKE should prioritize olùmúlò ààbò while minimizing unnecessary removals, discriminatory enforcement ati avoidable false positives.","SPIKE should protect private information and respect access boundaries.":"SPIKE should protect ìkọ̀kọ̀ alaye ati respect ìwọlé boundaries.","SPIKE supports text posts, photos, videos, links and 24-hour Stories.":"SPIKE supports text àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́, photos, videos, links ati 24-hour Àwọn ìtàn.","SPIKE was inspired by the word":"SPIKE was inspired by naa word","SPIKE · Progression":"SPIKE · Progression","SPIKE · World":"SPIKE · Ayé","SPIKE — Engagement":"SPIKE — Engagement","SPIKE — Feed":"SPIKE — Ìkànnì","SPIKE — Help Center":"SPIKE — Ìrànlọ́wọ́ Center","SPIKE — Messages":"SPIKE — Àwọn ifiranṣẹ́","SPIKE — Notifications":"SPIKE — Àwọn ìfitónilétí","SPIKE — Policy & Appeals":"SPIKE — Ìlànà & Appeals","SPIKE — Private Message":"SPIKE — Ìkọ̀kọ̀ Ifiranṣẹ́","SPIKE — Profile":"SPIKE — Profaili","SPIKE — Reset Password":"SPIKE — Tún ṣe Ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","SPIKE — Rooms":"SPIKE — Awọn yara","SPIKE — Settings":"SPIKE — Ètò","SPIKE — Shared":"SPIKE — Shared","SPIKE — Sign in":"SPIKE — Wole ní","SPIKE — The Complete Member Guide":"SPIKE — Naa Complete Ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ Ìtọ́sọ́nà","SPIKE • FOUNDER & SUPPORT":"SPIKE • FOUNDER & SUPPORT","SPIKE • Founder & Support":"SPIKE • F