Chain":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ Chain","Start a SPIKE":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ kan SPIKE","Start a video call":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ kan video ìpè","Start an audio call":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ kan audio ìpè","Start an idea and let people build on it one response at a time.":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ kan idea ati let àwọn ènìyàn build lórí it one response at kan àkókò.","Start as Novice":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ as Novice","Start chatting":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ chatting","Start collaboration":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ collaboration","Start exploring":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ exploring","Start here":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ here","Start message":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ ifiranṣẹ́","Start the first entry…":"Bẹ̀rẹ̀ naa first entry…","Started at age 15 while in school, determined to become a web developer and create something the world would acknowledge.":"Started at age 15 while ní ilé ẹ̀kọ́, determined si become kan web developer ati ṣẹ̀dá something naa ayé would acknowledge.","Status":"Ipo","Status: Checking…":"Ipo: Checking…","Stay in control of your SPIKE experience.":"Stay ní control ti rẹ SPIKE experience.","Step 2 of 2":"Step 2 ti 2","Stop engaging, use block/report tools where appropriate, and protect your private information. Do not retaliate or publish someone else''s private details.":"Stop engaging, lo dènà/ròyìn tools níbo appropriate, ati protect rẹ ìkọ̀kọ̀ alaye. Do not retaliate tabi publish someone else''s ìkọ̀kọ̀ details.","Stop normal app access during deployments or incidents. The setting is server-controlled.":"Stop deede app ìwọlé during deployments tabi incidents. Naa setting jẹ sàfà-controlled.","Stories":"Àwọn ìtàn","Stories expire after 24 hours. Add text, a photo/video, and optional audio directly from your device.":"Àwọn ìtàn expire after 24 hours. Add text, kan photo/video, ati àṣàyàn audio directly láti rẹ device.","Stories expire after 24 hours. You can create a Story from a photo/video and optional audio. Story actions can include sharing, sharing a Story, scheduling Story sharing, and deleting your own Story.":"Àwọn ìtàn expire after 24 hours. Ẹ le ṣẹ̀dá kan Ìtàn láti kan photo/video ati àṣàyàn audio. Ìtàn àwọn ìṣe le include sharing, sharing kan Ìtàn, scheduling Ìtàn sharing, ati deleting rẹ own Ìtàn.","Story":"Ìtàn","Story smart actions":"Ìtàn smart àwọn ìṣe","Story text…":"Ìtàn text…","Story viewer":"Ìtàn viewer","Streak multipliers JSON":"Ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí multipliers JSON","Streak rewards JSON":"Ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí rewards JSON","Stronger model signal. Still not guaranteed.":"Stronger model àmì. Still not guaranteed.","Student profile":"Student profaili","Study what performs well, then make your own original version instead of copying people.":"Study kí performs well, then make rẹ own original version instead ti copying àwọn ènìyàn.","Style 1":"Style 1","Subjects":"Subjects","Submit an appeal":"Submit kan ẹ̀bẹ̀","Submit appeal":"Submit ẹ̀bẹ̀","Submit report":"Submit ròyìn","Suggestions":"Suggestions","Suggestions are generated locally from your draft.":"Suggestions jẹ generated locally láti rẹ draft.","Super Admin":"Super Alákóso","Support Admin":"Support Alákóso","Support SPIKE":"Support SPIKE","Support checkout":"Support checkout","Support continued polish, reliability, accessibility and new community features.":"Support continued polish, reliability, accessibility ati tuntun àwùjọ features.","Sustained targeted abuse, threats, humiliation campaigns and coordinated harassment are prohibited. Ordinary disagreement or criticism is not automatically harassment.":"Sustained targeted abuse, threats, humiliation campaigns ati coordinated harassment jẹ ewọ̀. Ordinary disagreement tabi criticism jẹ not automatically harassment.","Switch between Room conversation channels.":"Switch between Yara ìjíròrò channels.","Switch style":"Switch style","Switch theme":"Switch akori","System":"Ètò","THE MEMBER PLAYBOOK":"Naa Ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ PLAYBOOK","THE SOCIAL LAYER BEYOND THE FEED":"Naa SOCIAL LAYER BEYOND Naa Ìkànnì","THE SPIKE IDEA":"Naa SPIKE IDEA","TODAY''S FOCUS":"lónìí''S FOCUS","TOP 50":"TOP 50","TOP PICKS":"TOP PICKS","Tags":"Tags","Take a quick check":"Take kan quick ṣàyẹ̀wò","Take a test":"Take kan test","Talk privately with eligible connections.":"Talk privately pẹ̀lú yẹ connections.","Tap a friend to open a private chat":"Tap kan ọ̀rẹ́ si ṣí kan ìkọ̀kọ̀ chat","Tap a member to view their profile, mention them, copy their username, share their profile, mute them locally, send a gift or open Top Ranking recommendations. Reporting is available when appropriate.":"Tap kan ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ si wo their profaili, mention them, ẹ̀dà their username, pín their profaili, mute them locally, ránṣẹ́ kan gift tabi ṣí Top Ìpele recommendations. Reporting jẹ wà nígbà appropriate.","Tap sides to navigate · Hold to pause":"Tap sides si navigate · Hold si pause","Tap to filter":"Tap si filter","Target":"Ìfojúsùn","Targeted harassment":"Targeted harassment","Team to Score":"Team si Score","Tell the Room community a little about you":"Tell naa Yara àwùjọ kan little nípa ẹ","Tell us what you were trying to do, where it happened, and what you saw. Never send passwords, authentication codes, private keys or other secrets.":"Tell us kí ẹ were trying si do, níbo it happened, ati kí ẹ saw. Never ránṣẹ́ passwords, authentication codes, ìkọ̀kọ̀ keys tabi míràn secrets.","Tell us what’s wrong with this message.":"Tell us kí’s wrong pẹ̀lú èyí ifiranṣẹ́.","Temporary account suspension":"Temporary akọọlẹ suspension","Temporary feature restriction":"Temporary feature restriction","Term / phrase":"Term / gbolóhùn","Terms":"Àwọn òfin","Terrorism and extremist violence":"Terrorism ati extremist violence","Test recall. Then use the result to decide what to review.":"Test recall. Then lo naa result si decide kí si àtúnyẹ̀wò.","Text Font Pack":"Text Font Pack","The 9-year journey":"Naa 9-ọdún journey","The Feed is the main discovery surface. It combines posts, stories, recommendations and creation tools.":"Naa Ìkànnì jẹ naa main ìwádìí surface. It combines àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́, àwọn ìtàn, recommendations ati creation tools.","The Feed''s AI/search surface can answer SPIKE questions and help search posts, people and topics. The local writing assistant can polish a draft, add a hook, shorten copy or suggest hashtags without requiring an external AI API key.":"Naa ìkànnì''s AI/wá surface le answer SPIKE questions ati ìrànlọ́wọ́ wá àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́, àwọn ènìyàn ati topics. Naa local writing assistant le polish kan draft, add kan hook, shorten ẹ̀dà tabi suggest hashtags without requiring kan external AI API key.","The Friends page helps you manage connections, pending requests, online people and suggestions.":"Naa Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ ojúewé helps ẹ ṣàkóso connections, pending àwọn ìbéèrè, lórí ayélujára àwọn ènìyàn ati suggestions.","The Gamification Hub shows the current top users by XP. Rankings are competitive and can change as members earn progress.":"Naa Gamification Hub shows naa current top àwọn olùmúlò by XP. Rankings jẹ competitive ati le yípadà as àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ earn ìlọsíwájú.","The Gamification Hub shows your authoritative progress, including XP, level, rank, streaks, daily tasks, weekly challenges, achievements, roadmap, leaderboard and XP history.":"Naa Gamification Hub shows rẹ authoritative ìlọsíwájú, including XP, ipele, rank, streaks, ojoojúmọ́ tasks, ọ̀sẹ̀ọ̀sẹ̀ challenges, achievements, roadmap, leaderboard ati XP history.","The Notifications page centralizes activity alerts.":"Naa Àwọn ìfitónilétí ojúewé centralizes iṣẹ́ alerts.","The Predictor ranks football fixtures and supported prediction markets using a model confidence signal.":"Naa Predictor ranks football fixtures ati ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn prediction markets using kan model ìgboyà àmì.","The Room may temporarily restrict posting, or your membership/role may not allow it. Check the Room information or ask a Room team member.":"Naa Yara le temporarily restrict posting, tabi rẹ membership/ipa le not allow it. Ṣàyẹ̀wò naa Yara alaye tabi ask kan Yara team ọmọ ẹgbẹ́.","The app tracks your progress. One visible requirement is an account age of at least 1 year 6 months.":"Naa app tracks rẹ ìlọsíwájú. One visible requirement jẹ kan akọọlẹ age ti at least 1 ọdún 6 months.","The beginning":"Naa beginning","The canonical workflow is pending → under review → approved or rejected. The system should prevent duplicate active appeals for the same moderation case.":"Naa canonical workflow jẹ pending → under àtúnyẹ̀wò → approved tabi rejected. Naa ètò should prevent duplicate ṣiṣẹ́ appeals fun naa same ìṣàkóso ọ̀ràn.","The current challenge uses community-safety scenarios. The visible pass threshold is 80%.":"Naa current challenge uses àwùjọ-ààbò scenarios. Naa visible pass threshold jẹ 80%.","The link will open the dedicated password-reset page where you can choose and save a new password.":"Naa ọ̀nà asopọ̀ will ṣí naa dedicated ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà-tún ṣe ojúewé níbo ẹ le yan ati fipamọ́ kan tuntun ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà.","The page says I am offline or content will not load.":"Naa ojúewé says I am offline tabi àkóónú will not load.","The person and story behind SPIKE.":"Naa person ati ìtàn behind SPIKE.","The removal or restriction notice should identify whether an appeal is available. An appeal should reference the original moderation case rather than creating an unrelated case.":"Naa removal tabi restriction notice should identify whether kan ẹ̀bẹ̀ jẹ wà. Kan ẹ̀bẹ̀ should reference naa original ìṣàkóso ọ̀ràn rather than creating kan unrelated ọ̀ràn.","The reset link opens a dedicated secure page where you can create and save your new password.":"Naa tún ṣe ọ̀nà asopọ̀ opens kan dedicated ààbò ojúewé níbo ẹ le ṣẹ̀dá ati fipamọ́ rẹ tuntun ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà.","The strongest SPIKE account is not the loudest one. It is the one that people trust, enjoy, learn from and want to return to.":"Naa strongest SPIKE akọọlẹ jẹ not naa loudest one. It jẹ naa one pé àwọn ènìyàn trust, enjoy, learn láti ati fẹ́ si return si.","Theme":"Akori","These additions use the existing Feed, composer, creator, notifications, profile and navigation systems. They do not replace your current buttons or routes.":"These additions lo naa existing Ìkànnì, composer, olùṣẹ̀dá, àwọn ìfitónilétí, profaili ati navigation systems. They do not replace rẹ current buttons tabi routes.","These are milestones, never manually claimed by members.":"These jẹ milestones, never manually claimed by àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́.","Think About Me":"Think Nípa Èmi","Think of SPIKE as a set of connected spaces. Use the destination that matches what you want to accomplish.":"Think ti SPIKE as kan set ti connected spaces. Lo naa destination pé matches kí ẹ fẹ́ si accomplish.","This Intelligence Suite is the foundation for a future personalized SPIKE home: people, conversations, communities, learning, predictions, events and creator activity in one place.":"Èyí Intelligence Suite jẹ naa foundation fun kan future personalized SPIKE ilé: àwọn ènìyàn, àwọn ìjíròrò, àwùjọ, learning, predictions, events ati olùṣẹ̀dá iṣẹ́ ní one place.","This guide is focused on using SPIKE and does not expose internal implementation details or secrets.":"Èyí ìtọ́sọ́nà jẹ focused lórí using SPIKE ati does not expose internal implementation details tabi secrets.","This image could not be displayed.":"Èyí image could not be displayed.","This is the policy source of truth for SPIKE safety, content moderation, enforcement, recommendations and appeals. Product systems should reference policy IDs and policy versions rather than duplicating rules.":"Èyí jẹ naa ìlànà source ti truth fun SPIKE ààbò, àkóónú ìṣàkóso, enforcement, recommendations ati appeals. Product systems should reference ìlànà IDs ati ìlànà versions rather than duplicating àwọn òfin.","This message will be permanently removed for everyone in this Room. This action cannot be undone.":"Èyí ifiranṣẹ́ will be permanently removed fun gbogbo ènìyàn ní èyí Yara. Èyí ìṣe cannot be undone.","This page is built around the confirmed SPIKE room contract: rooms + room_members. Visibility here is client-side only; Supabase RLS remains the final authorization boundary.":"Èyí ojúewé jẹ built around naa confirmed SPIKE yara contract: awọn yara + yara_àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́. Ìfarahàn here jẹ client-side nikan; Supabase RLS remains naa final authorization boundary.","This page is designed as the premium support front-end. Connect it to your verified payment provider/server endpoint before accepting real payments.":"Èyí ojúewé jẹ designed as naa premium support front-end. Sopọ̀ it si rẹ verified payment provider/sàfà endpoint ṣáájú accepting real payments.","This room may have been deleted, you may not have access, or the room ID is invalid.":"Èyí yara le have been deleted, ẹ le not have ìwọlé, tabi naa yara Idánimọ̀ jẹ invalid.","Threats of serious physical harm, targeted incitement of violence and credible plans to harm people are prohibited. Immediate-risk cases may receive priority escalation.":"Threats ti serious physical harm, targeted incitement ti violence ati credible plans si harm àwọn ènìyàn jẹ ewọ̀. Immediate-risk àwọn ọ̀ràn le receive priority escalation.","Tip:":"Tip:","Title":"Àkọlé","Today · Daily picks":"Lónìí · Ojoojúmọ́ picks","Today''s fixtures":"lónìí''s fixtures","Today''s fixtures ranked by the SPIKE model. Use the confidence signal to compare picks; no prediction is guaranteed.":"lónìí''s fixtures ranked by naa SPIKE model. Lo naa ìgboyà àmì si compare picks; rárá prediction jẹ guaranteed.","Today’s streak pool":"lónìí’s ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí pool","Top 25 by verified XP.":"Top 25 by verified XP.","Top Picks":"Top Picks","Top Signals":"Top Signals","Top-ranking formula:":"Top-ìpele formula:","Topics, comma separated":"Topics, comma separated","Total activity":"Total iṣẹ́","Track XP, levels, ranks, badges, achievements, streaks, tasks and leaderboard progress.":"Track XP, levels, ranks, badges, achievements, streaks, tasks ati leaderboard ìlọsíwájú.","Trailblazer":"Trailblazer","Translate":"Túmọ̀","Transparency":"Transparency","Treat it seriously and use the proper reporting/moderation path":"Treat it seriously ati lo naa proper reporting/ìṣàkóso path","Trending":"Trending","Trending now":"Trending bayìí","Trending rooms":"Trending awọn yara","Troubleshooting":"Troubleshooting","Trust, responsibility and the role they need":"Trust, responsibility ati naa ipa they níláti","Try: How do I make a video call?":"Try: Báwo do I make kan video ìpè?","Turn a Signal into a simple vote.":"Turn kan Àmì into kan simple vote.","Type your message.":"Type rẹ ifiranṣẹ́.","U":"U","Unauthorized access, credential theft, malware distribution, exploitation of security controls and deliberate disruption of SPIKE are prohibited.":"Unauthorized ìwọlé, credential theft, malware distribution, exploitation ti security controls ati deliberate disruption ti SPIKE jẹ ewọ̀.","Under 2.5":"Under 2.5","Understand computers, data and algorithms.":"Understand computers, data ati algorithms.","Unique people":"Unique àwọn ènìyàn","University":"University","University course explorer":"University ẹ̀kọ́ explorer","Unlock achievements":"Unlock awọn aṣeyọri","Unlocked automatically when the server verifies the requirement.":"Unlocked automatically nígbà naa sàfà verifies naa requirement.","Unmute video":"Unmute video","Unread":"Unread","Upcoming Room events are collected into one quick view.":"Upcoming Yara events jẹ collected into one quick wo.","Update your username, profile picture, cover image and profile information from your profile.":"Update rẹ username, profaili picture, cover image ati profaili alaye láti rẹ profaili.","Upheld":"Upheld","Uploading media securely.":"Uploading àwọn mídíà securely.","Use 8+ characters":"Lo 8+ characters","Use All, Unread, Pinned, Archived, Friends and Saved views.":"Lo Gbogbo, Unread, Pinned, Archived, Àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ ati Fipamọ́ àwọn ìwò.","Use Create, add text and media, optionally add a link, then publish.":"Lo Ṣẹ̀dá, add text ati àwọn mídíà, optionally add kan ọ̀nà asopọ̀, then publish.","Use Daily Check-in once for the day and protect your streak when it matters to you.":"Lo Ojoojúmọ́ Ṣàyẹ̀wò-ní once fun naa day ati protect rẹ ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí nígbà it matters si ẹ.","Use Discover to move from people and posts into related topics rather than relying only on a feed.":"Lo Ṣàwárí si move láti àwọn ènìyàn ati àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́ into related topics rather than relying nikan lórí kan ìkànnì.","Use For You, Discover, Trending, Reels, Nearby, Insights, Progress and Creator tools as available.":"Lo Fun Ẹ, Ṣàwárí, Trending, Reels, Nearby, Insights, Ìlọsíwájú ati Olùṣẹ̀dá tools as wà.","Use Forgot password on the sign-in page and follow the recovery link. The recovery page validates the password requirements before saving.":"Lo Gbàgbé ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà lórí naa wole-ní ojúewé ati follow naa múpadàbọ̀sípò ọ̀nà asopọ̀. Naa múpadàbọ̀sípò ojúewé validates naa ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà requirements ṣáájú saving.","Use Messages and start a conversation with an eligible friend/connection. Your message permissions depend on your privacy settings and theirs.":"Lo Àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ ati bẹ̀rẹ̀ kan ìjíròrò pẹ̀lú kan yẹ ọ̀rẹ́/ìsopọ̀. Rẹ ifiranṣẹ́ permissions depend lórí rẹ ìpamọ́ ètò ati theirs.","Use Refresh, check your membership, and verify that the Room is still available. Live connections can be interrupted temporarily.":"Lo Tún ṣe, ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ membership, ati verify pé naa Yara jẹ still wà. Live connections le be interrupted temporarily.","Use Save when you want to keep a post or supported content handy for later.":"Lo Fipamọ́ nígbà ẹ fẹ́ si pa mọ́ kan ìfìwéránṣẹ́ tabi ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn àkóónú handy fun later.","Use Settings and profile privacy controls to decide how much of your presence and profile activity you expose.":"Lo Ètò ati profaili ìpamọ́ controls si decide báwo much ti rẹ presence ati profaili iṣẹ́ ẹ expose.","Use Stories":"Lo Àwọn ìtàn","Use a clear name, useful bio, avatar and relevant profile details.":"Lo kan ko orúkọ, wúlò bio, avatar ati relevant profaili details.","Use an email you can access. New accounts verify through a temporary 6-digit email code.":"Lo kan imeeli ẹ le ìwọlé. Tuntun accounts verify nipasẹ̀ kan temporary 6-digit imeeli kóòdù.","Use an email you can access. We’ll send a 6-digit code to verify your account.":"Lo kan imeeli ẹ le ìwọlé. We’ll ránṣẹ́ kan 6-digit kóòdù si verify rẹ akọọlẹ.","Use appropriate moderation tools and explain the rule":"Lo appropriate ìṣàkóso tools ati explain naa rule","Use available controls to pin, mute, archive or save conversations and messages. Drafts and scheduling options can help you manage messages.":"Lo wà controls si dábàá, mute, archive tabi fipamọ́ àwọn ìjíròrò ati àwọn ifiranṣẹ́. Àwọn àkótán ati scheduling options le ìrànlọ́wọ́ ẹ ṣàkóso àwọn ifiranṣẹ́.","Use blocking controls when you no longer want to interact with an account.":"Lo blocking controls nígbà ẹ rárá longer fẹ́ si interact pẹ̀lú kan akọọlẹ.","Use in new Signal":"Lo ní tuntun Àmì","Use league and market filters, compare today''s fixtures and review the confidence labels. High confidence means a stronger model signal; it is not a guarantee of an outcome.":"Lo league ati market filters, compare lónìí''s fixtures ati àtúnyẹ̀wò naa ìgboyà labels. Gíga ìgboyà means kan stronger model àmì; it jẹ not kan guarantee ti kan outcome.","Use profile actions to block a member when needed. Blocking can restrict interaction.":"Lo profaili àwọn ìṣe si dènà kan ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ nígbà needed. Blocking le restrict interaction.","Use profile safety controls when you need to limit or stop interactions with another account.":"Lo profaili ààbò controls nígbà ẹ níláti si limit tabi stop interactions pẹ̀lú another akọọlẹ.","Use suggestions and the people area to discover new connections. Activity indicators may vary.":"Lo suggestions ati naa àwọn ènìyàn area si ṣàwárí tuntun connections. Iṣẹ́ indicators le vary.","Use the Room assistant when available for smart help.":"Lo naa Yara assistant nígbà wà fun smart ìrànlọ́wọ́.","Use the Room''s join option. Some Room experiences may require you to complete an account step before participating.":"Lo naa yara''s darapọ̀ option. Some Yara experiences le require ẹ si complete kan akọọlẹ step ṣáájú participating.","Use the available categories and unread filter to quickly find notifications that need your attention.":"Lo naa wà categories ati unread filter si quickly find àwọn ìfitónilétí pé níláti rẹ attention.","Use the available controls to mute your microphone, turn your camera on or off, and end the call.":"Lo naa wà controls si mute rẹ microphone, turn rẹ camera lórí tabi off, ati end naa ìpè.","Use the daily check-in and complete useful tasks consistently instead of bingeing activity.":"Lo naa ojoojúmọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò-ní ati complete wúlò tasks consistently instead ti bingeing iṣẹ́.","Use the email address connected to your SPIKE account.":"Lo naa imeeli address connected si rẹ SPIKE akọọlẹ.","Use the existing Engagement/Insights area for deeper creator analytics. This suite is the control layer that connects those insights to your wider SPIKE activity.":"Lo naa existing Engagement/Insights area fun deeper olùṣẹ̀dá analytics. Èyí suite jẹ naa control layer pé connects those insights si rẹ wider SPIKE iṣẹ́.","Use the main navigation to move between the areas you use most. If you get stuck, check the FAQ below.":"Lo naa main navigation si move between naa areas ẹ lo most. If ẹ get stuck, ṣàyẹ̀wò naa FAQ below.","Use the name you want displayed on your SPIKE profile.":"Lo naa orúkọ ẹ fẹ́ displayed lórí rẹ SPIKE profaili.","Use the password recovery option on the sign-in screen and follow the instructions.":"Lo naa ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà múpadàbọ̀sípò option lórí naa wole-ní screen ati follow naa instructions.","Use the profile sharing option to copy or share your profile with someone else.":"Lo naa profaili sharing option si ẹ̀dà tabi pín rẹ profaili pẹ̀lú someone else.","Use the same SPIKE theme preference across pages.":"Lo naa same SPIKE akori preference across pages.","Use the ☆ Save control on a prediction to keep it in your Saved view for quick access later.":"Lo naa ☆ Fipamọ́ control lórí kan prediction si pa mọ́ it ní rẹ Fipamọ́ wo fun quick ìwọlé later.","Use “Forgot password?” to receive a recovery link. The dedicated recovery page lets you choose a new password.":"Lo “Gbàgbé ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà?” si receive kan múpadàbọ̀sípò ọ̀nà asopọ̀. Naa dedicated múpadàbọ̀sípò ojúewé lets ẹ yan kan tuntun ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà.","Useful contributions are the goal. Do not spam empty entries or create endless activity only for progression.":"Wúlò contributions jẹ naa goal. Do not spam empty entries tabi ṣẹ̀dá endless iṣẹ́ nikan fun progression.","User":"Olùmúlò","User email":"Olùmúlò imeeli","User notices":"Olùmúlò notices","User requests":"Olùmúlò àwọn ìbéèrè","Username":"Username","Users":"Àwọn olùmúlò","Users are expected to participate without abusing people or the platform.":"Àwọn olùmúlò jẹ expected si kópa without abusing àwọn ènìyàn tabi naa platform.","Users are responsible for having appropriate rights to content they upload or share.":"Àwọn olùmúlò jẹ responsible fun having appropriate rights si àkóónú they upload tabi pín.","Users must not expose another person''s sensitive personal information without an appropriate lawful and legitimate basis. Admin access to private moderation data must be permission-controlled and audited.":"Àwọn olùmúlò must not expose another person''s sensitive personal alaye without kan appropriate lawful ati legitimate basis. Alákóso ìwọlé si ìkọ̀kọ̀ ìṣàkóso data must be permission-controlled ati audited.","Users should not upload material they do not have permission or a lawful basis to use. SPIKE should provide an appropriate copyright complaint and takedown process.":"Àwọn olùmúlò should not upload material they do not have permission tabi kan lawful basis si lo. SPIKE should provide kan appropriate copyright complaint ati takedown process.","VERIFYING":"VERIFYING","Velvet Nocturne":"Velvet Nocturne","Verification code":"Verification kóòdù","Verification progress":"Verification ìlọsíwájú","Verification status":"Verification ipo","Verified":"Verified","Verified metric":"Verified metric","Verify code":"Verify kóòdù","Versioning":"Versioning","Video call":"Video ìpè","View a case and submit an appeal":"Wo kan ọ̀ràn ati submit kan ẹ̀bẹ̀","View and participate in community events where available.":"Wo ati kópa ní àwùjọ events níbo wà.","View library →":"Wo library →","View profile":"Wo profaili","Views":"Àwọn ìwò","Violence":"Violence","Violence and credible threats":"Violence ati credible threats","Voice call":"Ohùn ìpè","Voice note":"Ohùn note","Voice notes":"Ohùn notes","Voice/video calls":"Ohùn/video calls","Vote in active polls. Where permitted, Room staff can create and manage them.":"Vote ní ṣiṣẹ́ ìdìbò. Níbo permitted, Yara staff le ṣẹ̀dá ati ṣàkóso them.","Voting and winning":"Voting ati winning","WAEC":"WAEC","WORLD":"Ayé","Wait briefly, then retry. If it still times out, check your connection and sign in again. A profile-loading problem should not prevent the rest of the app from being usable.":"Wait briefly, then gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kansi. If it still times out, ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ ìsopọ̀ ati wole ní again. Kan profaili-ń gbé problem should not prevent naa rest ti naa app láti being usable.","Wallet balances are backend-controlled.":"Wallet balances jẹ backend-controlled.","Warn":"Kìlọ̀","Warning or educational notice":"Warning tabi educational notice","We sent a 6-digit verification code to":"We sent kan 6-digit verification kóòdù si","We will be back shortly.":"We will be padà shortly.","Website":"Website","Weekly":"Ọ̀sẹ̀ọ̀sẹ̀","Weekly Challenges":"Ọ̀sẹ̀ọ̀sẹ̀ Challenges","Welcome":"Káàbọ̀","Welcome back":"Káàbọ̀ padà","Welcome to SPIKE":"Káàbọ̀ si SPIKE","Welcome to SPIKE — your place to connect with people, share updates, discover communities, chat privately, and stay in touch.":"Káàbọ̀ si SPIKE — rẹ place si sopọ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ènìyàn, pín updates, ṣàwárí àwùjọ, chat privately, ati stay ní touch.","Welcome to SPIKE! 🎉":"Káàbọ̀ si SPIKE! 🎉","What are you battling over?":"Kí jẹ ẹ battling over?","What brings this Circle together?":"Kí brings èyí Circle together?","What do you want people to hear?":"Kí do ẹ fẹ́ àwọn ènìyàn si hear?","What do you want to remember?":"Kí do ẹ fẹ́ si remember?","What is a Battle?":"Kí jẹ kan Battle?","What is a Circle?":"Kí jẹ kan Circle?","What is a Community Mission?":"Kí jẹ kan Àwùjọ Mission?","What is a Season?":"Kí jẹ kan Season?","What is a Signal Chain?":"Kí jẹ kan Àmì Chain?","What is included?":"Kí jẹ included?","What is this room about?":"Kí jẹ èyí yara nípa?","What should I do today?":"Kí should I do lónìí?","What should I include when contacting support?":"Kí should I include nígbà contacting support?","What should people build together?":"Kí should àwọn ènìyàn build together?","What should the community accomplish?":"Kí should naa àwùjọ accomplish?","What should this Feed focus on?":"Kí should èyí Ìkànnì focus lórí?","What to do when SPIKE is slow, signed out, or waiting for data.":"Kí si do nígbà SPIKE jẹ slow, signed out, tabi waiting fun data.","What your support means":"Kí rẹ support means","WhatsApp":"WhatsApp","When content is removed or restricted, the user notification should provide a clear reason and identify the applicable policy category when safe and appropriate to disclose.":"Nígbà àkóónú jẹ removed tabi restricted, naa olùmúlò notification should provide kan ko reason ati identify naa applicable ìlànà category nígbà safe ati appropriate si disclose.","When the mission reaches its server-defined target, the eligible completion reward is awarded once. You cannot manually grant yourself XP or change the reward from the browser.":"Nígbà naa mission reaches its sàfà-defined ìfojúsùn, naa yẹ completion reward jẹ awarded once. Ẹ cannot manually grant yourself XP tabi yípadà naa reward láti naa àwáríàyé.","When translation is available, use the translation action on a message and choose the language you want.":"Nígbà translation jẹ wà, lo naa translation ìṣe lórí kan ifiranṣẹ́ ati yan naa èdè ẹ fẹ́.","Where available, review performance, gamification progress and creator-oriented tools.":"Níbo wà, àtúnyẹ̀wò performance, gamification ìlọsíwájú ati olùṣẹ̀dá-oriented tools.","Where do I change privacy settings?":"Níbo do I yípadà ìpamọ́ ètò?","Where do I find my Rooms?":"Níbo do I find my Awọn yara?","Where do I go?":"Níbo do I go?","Where do I see my level and badge?":"Níbo do I see my ipele ati badge?","Where it began":"Níbo it began","Where supported, attach media or record a voice note. Your browser may ask for microphone permission when recording.":"Níbo ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn, attach àwọn mídíà tabi record kan ohùn note. Rẹ àwáríàyé le ask fun microphone permission nígbà recording.","Who asks first":"Ta asks first","Who can call you on SPIKE":"Ta le ìpè ẹ lórí SPIKE","Who can call you through private calls.":"Ta le ìpè ẹ nipasẹ̀ ìkọ̀kọ̀ calls.","Who can open your profile":"Ta le ṣí rẹ profaili","Who can start a conversation":"Ta le bẹ̀rẹ̀ kan ìjíròrò","Who can start private conversations with you.":"Ta le bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìkọ̀kọ̀ àwọn ìjíròrò pẹ̀lú ẹ.","Who can view media on your profile.":"Ta le wo àwọn mídíà lórí rẹ profaili.","Who can view your connections":"Ta le wo rẹ connections","Who can view your friends list.":"Ta le wo rẹ àwọn ọ̀rẹ́ list.","Who can view your posts.":"Ta le wo rẹ àwọn ìfìwéránṣẹ́.","Who can view your profile.":"Ta le wo rẹ profaili.","Whole word":"Whole word","Why SPIKE?":"Kí ló dé SPIKE?","Why aren''t my messages updating?":"Kí ló dé aren''t my àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ updating?","Why can''t I make a call?":"Kí ló dé le''t I make kan ìpè?","Why can''t I see a feature?":"Kí ló dé le''t I see kan feature?","Why can''t I send a Room message?":"Kí ló dé le''t I ránṣẹ́ kan Yara ifiranṣẹ́?","Why can''t I upload media?":"Kí ló dé le''t I upload àwọn mídíà?","Why did I get signed out?":"Kí ló dé did I get signed out?","Why should this action be reviewed?":"Kí ló dé should èyí ìṣe be reviewed?","Why the name “SPIKE”?":"Kí ló dé naa orúkọ “SPIKE”?","Why this term is governed and how it should be reviewed":"Kí ló dé èyí term jẹ governed ati báwo it should be reviewed","Win Either Half":"Win Either Half","Window":"Fèrèsé","World":"Ayé","Write a message":"Write kan ifiranṣẹ́","Write a message…":"Write kan ifiranṣẹ́…","Write clear rules, welcome members, moderate consistently and build useful community culture.":"Write ko àwọn òfin, káàbọ̀ àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́, moderate consistently ati build wúlò àwùjọ culture.","Write the first entry.":"Write naa first entry.","Write the message...":"Write naa ifiranṣẹ́...","Write to the Circle…":"Write si naa Circle…","XP":"XP","XP rewards JSON":"XP rewards JSON","XP thresholds remain authoritative. Editing a level never grants XP.":"XP thresholds remain authoritative. Editing kan ipele never grants XP.","XP, levels & streaks":"XP, levels & streaks","YOUR LIFETIME SP ID":"Rẹ LIFETIME SP Idánimọ̀","Yes — show as app announcement":"Bẹ́ẹ̀ni — fi hàn as app announcement","Yes, sign out":"Bẹ́ẹ̀ni, wole out","You become the room owner automatically.":"Ẹ become naa yara owner automatically.","You can mark notifications read, clear them, or delete read items. Settings can also control message sounds, incoming/outgoing call sounds and browser-level notifications when supported.":"Ẹ le mark àwọn ìfitónilétí read, ko them, tabi pa read items. Ètò le also control ifiranṣẹ́ sounds, incoming/outgoing ìpè sounds ati àwáríàyé-ipele àwọn ìfitónilétí nígbà ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn.","You can request a new code shortly.":"Ẹ le request kan tuntun kóòdù shortly.","You can switch among Latest, Following, Popular, Trending and Saved views. Feed controls can also include time windows, following-only and sensitive-content preferences.":"Ẹ le switch among Tuntun jù, Tẹ̀lé, Popular, Trending ati Fipamọ́ àwọn ìwò. Ìkànnì controls le also include àkókò windows, tẹ̀lé-nikan ati sensitive-àkóónú preferences.","You can switch paths at any time. SPIKE progress should support your real participation, not force you into a single style.":"Ẹ le switch paths at any àkókò. SPIKE ìlọsíwájú should support rẹ real participation, not force ẹ into kan single style.","You cannot vote for yourself.":"Ẹ cannot vote fun yourself.","You do not need to use every feature. Choose the path that fits how you want to participate.":"Ẹ do not níláti si lo every feature. Yan naa path pé fits báwo ẹ fẹ́ si kópa.","You do not type an XP amount. Higher XP means a harder mission. The server accepts only SPIKE-defined tiers.":"Ẹ do not type kan XP amount. Higher XP means kan harder mission. Naa sàfà accepts nikan SPIKE-defined tiers.","You have already started fractions. Finish the concept, practise it once, then test yourself before moving to algebra.":"Ẹ have already started fractions. Finish naa concept, practise it once, then test yourself ṣáájú moving si algebra.","You need a Room Account before you can join, read or send messages in a Room. Create your account from the Rooms page, then return to this Room.":"Ẹ níláti kan Yara Akọọlẹ ṣáájú ẹ le darapọ̀, read tabi ránṣẹ́ àwọn ifiranṣẹ́ ní kan Yara. Ṣẹ̀dá rẹ akọọlẹ láti naa Awọn yara ojúewé, then return si èyí Yara.","Your Account & Profile":"Rẹ Akọọlẹ & Profaili","Your Room Account":"Rẹ Yara Akọọlẹ","Your Rooms account":"Rẹ Awọn yara akọọlẹ","Your SP ID is your unique SPIKE account identification number.":"Rẹ SP Idánimọ̀ jẹ rẹ unique SPIKE akọọlẹ identification number.","Your SPIKE password has been changed successfully. Continue to your account.":"Rẹ SPIKE ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà has been changed successfully. Tẹ̀síwájú si rẹ akọọlẹ.","Your SPIKE, connected.":"Rẹ SPIKE, connected.","Your Signal":"Rẹ Àmì","Your XP total maps to a level using the SPIKE level roadmap.":"Rẹ XP total maps si kan ipele using naa SPIKE ipele roadmap.","Your account is created and authenticated through SPIKE''s sign-in flow. Your lifetime SP ID is your permanent SPIKE account identifier.":"Rẹ akọọlẹ jẹ created ati authenticated nipasẹ̀ SPIKE''s wole-ní flow. Rẹ lifetime SP Idánimọ̀ jẹ rẹ permanent SPIKE akọọlẹ identifier.","Your account is verified and your permanent SPIKE identity is ready.":"Rẹ akọọlẹ jẹ verified ati rẹ permanent SPIKE ìdánimọ̀ jẹ ready.","Your appeals":"Rẹ appeals","Your choice stays yours.":"Rẹ choice stays yours.","Your complete SPIKE playbook.":"Rẹ complete SPIKE playbook.","Your connections":"Rẹ connections","Your controls":"Rẹ controls","Your conversations":"Rẹ àwọn ìjíròrò","Your engagement":"Rẹ engagement","Your first few steps in SPIKE.":"Rẹ first few steps ní SPIKE.","Your friends":"Rẹ àwọn ọ̀rẹ́","Your full name":"Rẹ full orúkọ","Your goal changes the study path we recommend.":"Rẹ goal àwọn àyípadà naa study path we recommend.","Your identity, level and reputation inside SPIKE Rooms.":"Rẹ ìdánimọ̀, ipele ati reputation inside SPIKE Awọn yara.","Your invitations":"Rẹ invitations","Your network":"Rẹ network","Your password":"Rẹ ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà","Your personalized feed. Ranking can respond to your interests and interactions.":"Rẹ personalized ìkànnì. Ìpele le respond si rẹ interests ati interactions.","Your policy cases":"Rẹ ìlànà àwọn ọ̀ràn","Your profile":"Rẹ profaili","Your profile can display a SPIKE QR code. A nearby person can scan it and connect instantly when the feature is available.":"Rẹ profaili le display kan SPIKE QR kóòdù. Kan nearby person le scan it ati sopọ̀ instantly nígbà naa feature jẹ wà.","Your progress":"Rẹ ìlọsíwájú","Your recovery link is active. Choose a new password below and save it to your SPIKE account.":"Rẹ múpadàbọ̀sípò ọ̀nà asopọ̀ jẹ ṣiṣẹ́. Yan kan tuntun ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà below ati fipamọ́ it si rẹ SPIKE akọọlẹ.","Your selected XP tier determines the mission difficulty, target and time window. These values are enforced by SPIKE.":"Rẹ selected XP tier determines naa mission difficulty, ìfojúsùn ati àkókò fèrèsé. These values jẹ enforced by SPIKE.","Your session may have expired or become invalid. Sign in again. If it keeps happening, check your internet connection and browser settings.":"Rẹ session le have expired tabi become invalid. Wole ní again. If it keeps happening, ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ internet ìsopọ̀ ati àwáríàyé ètò.","Your session will be signed out on this device. You can sign back in anytime.":"Rẹ session will be signed out lórí èyí device. Ẹ le wole padà ní anytime.","Your streak is based on consecutive server dates, not button presses.":"Rẹ ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí jẹ based lórí consecutive sàfà dates, not button presses.","Your study space":"Rẹ study space","Your value is measured by meaningful participation, not follower count alone.":"Rẹ value jẹ measured by meaningful participation, not follower count alone.","You’ll need access to this inbox to receive your verification code.":"ẹ’ll níláti ìwọlé si èyí inbox si receive rẹ verification kóòdù.","_PREDICTOR":"_PREDICTOR","actions per person":"àwọn ìṣe per person","checking":"checking","complete profile + consistent quality + meaningful connections + Room participation + healthy streak + respectful behavior.":"complete profaili + consistent quality + meaningful connections + Yara participation + healthy ọ̀wọ̀n àṣeyọrí + respectful behavior.","control your seasonal ranking. They are separate systems.":"control rẹ seasonal ìpele. They jẹ separate systems.","controls your normal SPIKE level.":"controls rẹ deede SPIKE ipele.","crypto, tech, general":"crypto, tech, general","days":"ọjọ́","e.g. CryptoTalk":"e.g. CryptoTalk","e.g. SPIKE":"e.g. SPIKE","early progress stays approachable, while higher levels require increasingly more verified XP. Existing levels are protected from regression; future level-ups use the harder roadmap. SPIKE progression is calculated from verified server activity. Messages, Signals, Rooms, Echoes, streaks and challenges are checked before XP or achievements are awarded.":"early ìlọsíwájú stays approachable, while higher levels require increasingly síi verified XP. Existing levels jẹ protected láti regression; future ipele-ups lo naa harder roadmap. SPIKE progression jẹ calculated láti verified sàfà iṣẹ́. Àwọn ifiranṣẹ́, Signals, Awọn yara, Echoes, streaks ati challenges jẹ checked ṣáájú XP tabi achievements jẹ awarded.","football predictions.":"football predictions.","give it a title, optional description, then write the first link.":"give it kan àkọlé, àṣàyàn àpèjúwe, then write naa first ọ̀nà asopọ̀.","https://example.com":"https://example.com","if you would not do the action without the XP reward, reconsider whether it is valuable participation.":"if ẹ would not do naa ìṣe without naa XP reward, reconsider whether it jẹ valuable participation.","now":"bayìí","old. The current status is verified by SPIKE.":"old. Naa current ipo jẹ verified by SPIKE.","or continue with":"tabi tẹ̀síwájú pẹ̀lú","or paste an image URL":"tabi paste kan image URL","people who engaged":"àwọn ènìyàn ta engaged","pt>":"pt>","s":"s","the client cannot award XP, mark a mission complete, or unlock an achievement. The database verifies the underlying activity first.":"naa client cannot award XP, mark kan mission complete, tabi unlock kan achievement. Naa database verifies naa underlying iṣẹ́ first.","unread notification":"unread notification","use a stable connection and an up-to-date browser. Headphones can reduce echo.":"lo kan stable ìsopọ̀ ati kan sókè-si-date àwáríàyé. Headphones le reduce echo.","use the Predictor page from the app when available. Your saved picks stay separate from the social Feed.":"lo naa Predictor ojúewé láti naa app nígbà wà. Rẹ fipamọ́ picks stay separate láti naa social Ìkànnì.","you@example.com":"ẹ@example.com","your SP ID stays connected to your SPIKE account for its lifetime.":"rẹ SP Idánimọ̀ stays connected si rẹ SPIKE akọọlẹ fun its lifetime.","your email":"rẹ imeeli","© 2026 SPIKE. All rights reserved.":"© 2026 SPIKE. Gbogbo rights reserved.","“Connect people. Encourage expression. Give everyone a voice. Build something the world can acknowledge.”":"“Sopọ̀ àwọn ènìyàn. Encourage expression. Give gbogbo ènìyàn kan ohùn. Build something naa ayé le acknowledge.”","“Speak.”":"“Speak.”","“You can always achieve whatever you wish to know by putting ef